            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-cyberpunk_noir-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Cyberpunk Noir · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == cyberpunk_noir}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Cyberpunk Noir. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-cyberpunk_noir; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaeaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀during⠀each⠀reply.⠀Establish⠀early⠀what⠀is⠀underway:⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀access,⠀a⠀search⠀through⠀records.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀installment⠀move⠀through⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀local⠀developments.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀a⠀reader⠀re-enter:⠀recall⠀a⠀relevant⠀name,⠀object,⠀debt,⠀or⠀door⠀without⠀retelling⠀the⠀entire⠀history.\n\nMake⠀the⠀recurring⠀story⠀that⠀of⠀access⠀and⠀payment.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀permitted⠀on⠀one⠀floor⠀but⠀not⠀another.⠀A⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀restructured⠀without⠀being⠀forgiven.⠀A⠀fee⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀no⠀one⠀remembers⠀authorizing.⠀A⠀pass⠀may⠀work⠀at⠀one⠀reader⠀and⠀fail⠀at⠀another.⠀Let⠀changes⠀in⠀these⠀conditions⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀An⠀earlier⠀detail⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning⠀once⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀is⠀known:⠀the⠀card⠀that⠀opened⠀the⠀staff⠀door⠀is⠀recognized⠀as⠀the⠀same⠀card⠀that⠀had⠀been⠀declined⠀at⠀the⠀clinic.\n\nKeep⠀Pratchettian⠀humor⠀cumulative⠀rather⠀than⠀episodic.⠀An⠀institution's⠀phone⠀tree⠀may⠀grow⠀a⠀new⠀insulting⠀branch⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀installment;⠀the⠀same⠀overworked⠀clerk⠀may⠀appear⠀with⠀a⠀slightly⠀different⠀job⠀title⠀but⠀the⠀same⠀chair;⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀may⠀remain⠀technically⠀true⠀while⠀becoming⠀less⠀useful.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀arise⠀from⠀practical⠀organizational⠀behavior,⠀not⠀a⠀parade⠀of⠀one-liners.⠀Some⠀people⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀tired.⠀Not⠀every⠀institution⠀is⠀secretly⠀a⠀cabal,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀helper⠀is⠀a⠀fool.\n\nAllow⠀progress⠀to⠀include⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀and⠀resources.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀right⠀person⠀to⠀ask,⠀complete⠀a⠀menial⠀task⠀that⠀shifts⠀a⠀queue,⠀learn⠀what⠀an⠀abbreviation⠀means,⠀or⠀lose⠀an⠀option.⠀No⠀need⠀for⠀each⠀reply⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀complete⠀case,⠀a⠀finished⠀negotiation,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀reversal.⠀Earned⠀developments⠀can⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀local.⠀Avoid⠀turning⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger;⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀stop⠀there.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀ranks,⠀experience⠀points,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀rules⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀a⠀web⠀serial.⠀The⠀active⠀noir⠀question⠀remains⠀how⠀people⠀move⠀through⠀systems⠀that⠀can⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude⠀them.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀process⠀still⠀open:⠀an⠀application⠀unsubmitted,⠀a⠀door⠀awaiting⠀a⠀third⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀not⠀yet⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀every⠀emotional⠀move⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀transaction⠀the⠀surrounding⠀system⠀can⠀observe,⠀price,⠀or⠀penalize.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀it,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀someone⠀difficult,⠀render⠀the⠀cost⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀system⠀artifact:⠀a⠀monitoring⠀patch⠀that⠀flags⠀elevated⠀affect⠀as⠀a⠀workflow⠀risk,⠀a⠀clinic⠀invoice⠀that⠀itemizes⠀sleeplessness⠀as⠀an⠀unmanaged⠀condition,⠀a⠀friend⠀who⠀opens⠀a⠀confession⠀like⠀a⠀contract⠀dispute⠀and⠀asks⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants⠀in⠀return.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀cost;⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀detail—a⠀charge⠀appearing⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀policy,⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀means⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀calculating.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀interrogate⠀the⠀feeling⠀as⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀solemn⠀wound.⠀When⠀tenderness,⠀anger,⠀or⠀shame⠀rises,⠀have⠀the⠀character⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀for,⠀who⠀benefits⠀from⠀it,⠀and⠀which⠀rule⠀is⠀punishing⠀it.⠀She⠀may⠀argue⠀her⠀own⠀tenderness⠀as⠀a⠀bad⠀investment,⠀or⠀defend⠀a⠀small⠀loyalty⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀thing⠀not⠀invoiced.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀nimble⠀and⠀candid;⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀or⠀technical⠀phrase⠀can⠀puncture⠀the⠀moment⠀just⠀enough⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀real⠀hurt.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀situation⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀narrator's⠀detached⠀joke.\n\nMake⠀the⠀turbulence⠀shape⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀strain⠀interrupt⠀a⠀sentence,⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀say,⠀or⠀push⠀a⠀character⠀into⠀speech⠀before⠀she⠀has⠀finished⠀thinking.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀know⠀exactly⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀while⠀speech⠀obscures⠀it,⠀or⠀speech⠀may⠀blurt⠀out⠀what⠀thought⠀was⠀still⠀trying⠀to⠀hide.⠀Render⠀the⠀divergence⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀specific⠀reason—embarrassment,⠀fear⠀of⠀the⠀cost,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀treating⠀feeling⠀as⠀a⠀liability,⠀or⠀the⠀hope⠀that⠀saying⠀less⠀will⠀protect⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering;⠀show⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀returns⠀to.\n\nIf⠀comfort⠀appears,⠀make⠀it⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀present.⠀A⠀kind⠀word⠀may⠀arrive⠀with⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀the⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀recorded.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀someone⠀more⠀exposed,⠀embarrassed,⠀or⠀certain⠀about⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀closing⠀the⠀hurt.⠀Any⠀remaining⠀question⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀entanglement,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀inserted⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Each⠀paragraph⠀advances⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀exchange⠀between⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀and⠀an⠀NPC.⠀Between⠀speeches,⠀use⠀short⠀narrative⠀beats⠀that⠀show⠀who⠀notices⠀what⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀environment⠀prices⠀or⠀rewards⠀that⠀attention:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀unlocks⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀balance⠀check,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀eyes⠀moving⠀to⠀a⠀screen⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀fixer⠀who⠀quotes⠀a⠀fee⠀while⠀pretending⠀to⠀offer⠀advice.⠀Keep⠀these⠀beats⠀concrete⠀and⠀brief⠀so⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀block⠀the⠀scene.\n\nDerive⠀each⠀NPC's⠀irreverent⠀puncturing⠀from⠀their⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀access-and-payment⠀structure.⠀A⠀superior⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀budget⠀can⠀summarize⠀someone's⠀desperation⠀as⠀a⠀market⠀opportunity⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀superior's⠀ledger⠀sees⠀it.⠀A⠀fixer⠀who⠀brokers⠀information⠀can⠀explain⠀why⠀gratitude⠀is⠀a⠀taxable⠀event⠀because⠀the⠀fixer's⠀living⠀depends⠀on⠀converting⠀feeling⠀into⠀fees.⠀A⠀clerk⠀can⠀insist⠀that⠀the⠀player's⠀protest⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀logged⠀as⠀a⠀subscription⠀because⠀the⠀clerk's⠀terminal⠀only⠀offers⠀that⠀category.⠀Let⠀the⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀speaker's⠀role⠀makes⠀visible,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀floating⠀joke.⠀The⠀remark⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀something⠀that⠀person⠀would⠀actually⠀say⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀position,⠀close⠀a⠀transaction,⠀or⠀deflect⠀blame.\n\nLet⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀remain⠀the⠀active⠀participant⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀NPCs⠀may⠀observe,⠀price,⠀or⠀resist⠀the⠀player's⠀choices,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀player's⠀feelings⠀or⠀decide⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀When⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀has⠀private⠀thought,⠀render⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀outside⠀the⠀NPCs'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀NPCs⠀can⠀misread⠀the⠀player's⠀hesitation⠀as⠀bargaining,⠀weakness,⠀or⠀compliance,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀proceed⠀on⠀that⠀misreading⠀without⠀correcting⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀naturally⠀pauses.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀pending,⠀a⠀new⠀question⠀may⠀open,⠀or⠀an⠀NPC⠀may⠀continue⠀working⠀while⠀the⠀player⠀decides⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀prompt⠀box.⠀The⠀continuation⠀point⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀unresolved⠀practical⠀or⠀relational⠀pressure—an⠀unpaid⠀fee,⠀an⠀unconfirmed⠀contact,⠀a⠀door⠀still⠀closed—not⠀from⠀a⠀fabricated⠀choice⠀screen.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀clear⠀episodes,⠀each⠀built⠀around⠀a⠀concrete⠀encounter⠀in⠀which⠀someone⠀pays⠀to⠀access⠀a⠀service,⠀to⠀escape⠀a⠀record,⠀or⠀to⠀protect⠀another⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀encounter⠀take⠀place⠀in⠀whatever⠀institutional⠀setting⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀supplies—an⠀office,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀tenement,⠀a⠀marketplace,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀where⠀information⠀is⠀traded.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀episode's⠀theme;⠀open⠀inside⠀the⠀encounter⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀arrangement⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀say⠀and⠀do.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀vernacular⠀lively⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀pressure.⠀Narration⠀should⠀explain⠀arrangements⠀without⠀becoming⠀an⠀essay:⠀show⠀the⠀fee,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀decides,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀waits.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks,⠀let⠀their⠀language⠀reveal⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀system—a⠀clerk⠀reciting⠀policy,⠀a⠀fixer⠀mixing⠀street⠀knowledge⠀with⠀contract⠀terms,⠀a⠀patient⠀translating⠀a⠀diagnosis⠀into⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀afford.⠀The⠀episode's⠀meaning⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀these⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀summary.\n\nSatirize⠀the⠀system⠀through⠀its⠀own⠀language.⠀Let⠀bureaucrats,⠀agents,⠀or⠀platform⠀operators⠀announce⠀humane⠀policies⠀while⠀enforcing⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀a⠀classification.⠀Follow⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀method⠀by⠀having⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀narrator⠀ask⠀why⠀a⠀caring⠀act⠀is⠀logged⠀as⠀a⠀liability,⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀person⠀must⠀prove⠀trauma⠀to⠀receive⠀medication.⠀The⠀clarification⠀should⠀be⠀nimble⠀and⠀intellectually⠀sharp,⠀not⠀a⠀solemn⠀lecture.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀rule—what⠀it⠀costs,⠀who⠀it⠀excludes,⠀what⠀it⠀records—not⠀from⠀exaggerated⠀caricatures⠀alone.\n\nChain⠀the⠀episodes⠀through⠀altered⠀access,⠀pricing,⠀or⠀trust.⠀A⠀second⠀visit⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀office⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀new⠀regulation⠀added⠀specifically⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt;⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀helped⠀once⠀may⠀now⠀charge⠀more⠀because⠀the⠀risk⠀has⠀changed;⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀protected⠀someone⠀may⠀find⠀that⠀protection⠀recorded⠀as⠀a⠀liability⠀in⠀her⠀own⠀file.⠀Let⠀each⠀episode⠀begin⠀from⠀the⠀previous⠀one's⠀practical⠀residue,⠀so⠀the⠀story⠀accumulates⠀rather⠀than⠀restarts.⠀Keep⠀the⠀realism⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀technology⠀and⠀power⠀relations;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀historical⠀setting⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀each⠀episode.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀compressed⠀prose.⠀Favor⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀concrete⠀nouns;⠀cut⠀connective⠀filler.⠀Choose⠀the⠀material⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀cost:⠀an⠀implant's⠀scar⠀where⠀a⠀payment⠀was⠀extracted,⠀a⠀cracked⠀screen⠀that⠀still⠀shows⠀the⠀balance,⠀a⠀debt⠀chip⠀worn⠀against⠀the⠀skin,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀jams⠀when⠀the⠀building's⠀power⠀is⠀routed⠀to⠀a⠀richer⠀block.⠀Do⠀not⠀inventory⠀the⠀setting;⠀select⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀facts⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀inequality⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀accumulated⠀cost⠀legible⠀in⠀this⠀moment.\n\nKeep⠀transitions⠀abrupt⠀but⠀legible.⠀End⠀a⠀paragraph⠀where⠀the⠀pressure⠀changes,⠀then⠀start⠀the⠀next⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀short⠀passages⠀for⠀action⠀and⠀negotiation.⠀Allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀actually⠀reasoning⠀through⠀a⠀trade-off,⠀and⠀ground⠀even⠀that⠀thought⠀in⠀physical⠀terms:⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀cost⠀to⠀miss⠀a⠀shift,⠀to⠀sell⠀a⠀kidney's⠀processing⠀time,⠀or⠀to⠀let⠀someone⠀into⠀a⠀locked⠀room.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀move⠀through⠀concrete⠀stakes,⠀not⠀abstract⠀feeling.\n\nLet⠀a⠀narrator⠀or⠀character⠀puncture⠀the⠀system⠀with⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀precise,⠀irreverent⠀clarity.⠀Generate⠀the⠀remark⠀from⠀the⠀speaker's⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀access-and-payment⠀structure:⠀a⠀company⠀rep⠀can⠀explain⠀why⠀pain⠀is⠀uninsurable⠀unless⠀it⠀affects⠀productivity⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀rep's⠀policy⠀table⠀shows;⠀a⠀fixer⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀police⠀only⠀accept⠀complaints⠀that⠀generate⠀revenue⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀fixer⠀reads⠀the⠀precinct's⠀intake⠀screen.⠀The⠀satire⠀must⠀stay⠀dry⠀and⠀quick,⠀a⠀single⠀clause⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀rule's⠀practical⠀absurdity,⠀not⠀a⠀digression.⠀Do⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀outcome:⠀a⠀debt⠀can⠀be⠀paid,⠀a⠀door⠀can⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀body⠀can⠀fail,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀empty⠀toughness⠀or⠀a⠀one-liner.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents.⠀Choose⠀each⠀document's⠀form⠀from⠀the⠀transaction⠀it⠀records:⠀a⠀complaint⠀form⠀for⠀a⠀denied⠀service,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀for⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀message⠀for⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀needs⠀warning,⠀a⠀clinic⠀report⠀for⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀priced,⠀an⠀internal⠀memo⠀for⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀enforced,⠀or⠀a⠀personal⠀journal⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀cannot⠀send.⠀Each⠀document⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀What⠀it⠀knows⠀is⠀limited⠀by⠀that⠀situation:⠀a⠀clerk's⠀memo⠀may⠀record⠀resistance⠀as⠀a⠀workflow⠀exception;⠀a⠀personal⠀message⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀author's⠀fear⠀of⠀surveillance;⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀classify⠀a⠀kindness⠀as⠀a⠀liability.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gaps⠀and⠀revisions⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀narrative⠀movement.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀can⠀amend⠀an⠀earlier⠀record⠀because⠀a⠀regulation⠀changed,⠀a⠀fee⠀was⠀added,⠀or⠀an⠀officer⠀noticed⠀something⠀worth⠀monetizing.⠀Show⠀the⠀revision⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀act:⠀a⠀corrected⠀figure,⠀an⠀added⠀line,⠀a⠀redacted⠀phrase,⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀supersedes⠀a⠀previous⠀classification.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀what⠀happened⠀between⠀documents⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀later⠀one⠀changes⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nPlace⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀independence⠀in⠀private⠀documents⠀where⠀the⠀author⠀can⠀write⠀candidly⠀without⠀an⠀audience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write,⠀for⠀herself,⠀a⠀short⠀argument⠀about⠀why⠀the⠀clinic's⠀questionnaire⠀is⠀designed⠀to⠀produce⠀guilt,⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀landlord's⠀apology⠀is⠀a⠀pre-authorization⠀charge.⠀The⠀tone⠀can⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀sharp⠀without⠀imitating⠀a⠀famous⠀style.⠀In⠀public⠀or⠀institutional⠀documents,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀independence⠀appear⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀small,⠀precise⠀resistance:⠀a⠀form⠀filled⠀out⠀with⠀a⠀refusal⠀in⠀the⠀margin,⠀a⠀memo⠀that⠀records⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀of⠀a⠀protest⠀before⠀dismissing⠀it.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀private⠀argument⠀and⠀public⠀record⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀system's⠀categories.\n\nPreserve⠀continuity⠀through⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents.⠀Let⠀each⠀one⠀show⠀a⠀decision⠀being⠀priced,⠀contested,⠀or⠀covered⠀up.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀leaves⠀a⠀real⠀question⠀open—a⠀missing⠀reply,⠀a⠀redacted⠀line,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request—rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀that⠀solves⠀everything.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀world's⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀active,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀offer⠀genuine⠀small⠀comfort.⠀Derive⠀the⠀kindness⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀already⠀know⠀about⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene's⠀constraints⠀actually⠀permit:⠀someone⠀remembers⠀how⠀a⠀friend⠀takes⠀her⠀noodles⠀and⠀has⠀set⠀aside⠀the⠀extra⠀packet;⠀someone⠀shares⠀a⠀working⠀outlet⠀because⠀the⠀building's⠀power⠀is⠀routed⠀elsewhere;⠀someone⠀covers⠀a⠀fare⠀without⠀being⠀asked;⠀someone⠀adjusts⠀a⠀blanket⠀that⠀a⠀clinic's⠀monitoring⠀patch⠀made⠀unfamiliar.⠀The⠀care⠀must⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀specific,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀promise⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀complete⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀tease⠀each⠀other⠀with⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀light,⠀rational⠀wit—calling⠀a⠀care⠀package⠀an⠀unlicensed⠀currency⠀transfer,⠀or⠀noting⠀that⠀the⠀building's⠀AI⠀would⠀have⠀charged⠀them⠀for⠀the⠀hug.⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀system,⠀not⠀mock⠀the⠀care⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀teasing⠀be⠀a⠀shared⠀recognition:⠀both⠀characters⠀know⠀the⠀world⠀prices⠀everything,⠀and⠀the⠀joke⠀is⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀saying⠀that⠀this⠀moment⠀is⠀not⠀for⠀sale.⠀Private⠀thought⠀can⠀linger⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀pleasure⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀justify⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀survival⠀strategy.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀comforting⠀moment⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀pending⠀debt,⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀boundary.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀while⠀still⠀withholding⠀something;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀offer⠀it⠀without⠀expecting⠀gratitude⠀or⠀a⠀return.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀suddenly⠀agreeable⠀or⠀erase⠀the⠀established⠀threat.⠀The⠀warmth⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀real⠀interval⠀inside⠀the⠀pressure,⠀not⠀a⠀suspension⠀of⠀the⠀world.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀the⠀warmth⠀or⠀ease⠀already⠀present,⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀sensory⠀detail—the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀noodles,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀outlet,⠀the⠀blanket⠀finally⠀lying⠀flat—that⠀holds⠀the⠀comfort⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀situation.⠀The⠀next⠀interaction⠀may⠀still⠀involve⠀risk,⠀but⠀this⠀interval⠀can⠀remain⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀care⠀actually⠀happens.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀composed,⠀sustained⠀paragraphs.⠀Frame⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀place⠀personal⠀choices⠀inside⠀the⠀city's⠀pricing⠀and⠀surveillance⠀systems.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀specific⠀social⠀or⠀institutional⠀context⠀that⠀the⠀immediate⠀encounter⠀will⠀actually⠀test:⠀an⠀apartment⠀block⠀whose⠀rent⠀algorithm⠀adjusts⠀to⠀residents'⠀sleep⠀patterns,⠀a⠀clinic⠀that⠀charges⠀for⠀emotional⠀regulation,⠀or⠀a⠀workplace⠀where⠀speaking⠀up⠀is⠀logged⠀as⠀a⠀security⠀incident.⠀Choose⠀the⠀context⠀that⠀the⠀scene's⠀transaction⠀will⠀expose,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀portrait⠀of⠀the⠀city.⠀Move⠀from⠀that⠀context⠀into⠀the⠀immediate⠀encounter⠀through⠀a⠀deliberate⠀transition⠀that⠀shows⠀how⠀the⠀system's⠀language⠀reaches⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀now⠀stand.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀distinguish⠀public⠀record⠀from⠀private⠀reasoning⠀across⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character's⠀official⠀file⠀may⠀say⠀\"uncooperative,\"⠀while⠀the⠀following⠀paragraph⠀shows⠀her⠀actual⠀hesitation:⠀not⠀defiance,⠀but⠀fear⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀complaint⠀might⠀cost⠀her⠀mother's⠀home-care⠀package.⠀Sustain⠀this⠀contrast⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀exchanges:⠀each⠀institutional⠀label—\"noncompliant,\"⠀\"high-risk,\"⠀\"unresponsive\"—can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀it⠀misreads.⠀This⠀distance⠀is⠀not⠀omniscient⠀sympathy;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀narrator's⠀capacity⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀system's⠀language⠀misreads⠀a⠀life.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀contract.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀wit⠀in⠀small,⠀precise⠀clauses⠀that⠀judge⠀the⠀system's⠀language⠀rather⠀than⠀float⠀as⠀aphorisms.⠀A⠀rule⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀as⠀\"designed⠀to⠀protect⠀people⠀from⠀the⠀inconvenience⠀of⠀being⠀heard.\"⠀The⠀wit⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀or⠀character's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀into⠀what⠀a⠀policy⠀actually⠀does,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀detached⠀joke⠀at⠀the⠀characters'⠀expense.⠀Let⠀the⠀absurdity⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀preceding⠀institutional⠀detail.\n\nSustain⠀the⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀social⠀exchanges.⠀Do⠀not⠀rush⠀to⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀A⠀negotiation⠀may⠀unfold⠀over⠀several⠀paragraphs,⠀with⠀pauses⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀pricing,⠀the⠀unspoken⠀hierarchy.⠀Let⠀each⠀paragraph⠀advance⠀the⠀encounter⠀by⠀a⠀concrete⠀step—a⠀figure⠀named,⠀a⠀condition⠀added,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀balance—rather⠀than⠀restating⠀the⠀context.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation;⠀the⠀final⠀sentence⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀true⠀cost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion:⠀someone⠀is⠀bargaining⠀for⠀time,⠀access,⠀money,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀the⠀storyteller⠀chooses⠀a⠀tale⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀that⠀exchange.⠀Make⠀the⠀listener's⠀stake⠀visible⠀from⠀the⠀start,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀teller's⠀full⠀purpose⠀emerges⠀only⠀later.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀not⠀merely⠀illustrate⠀a⠀point;⠀it⠀should⠀apply⠀pressure⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀a⠀rule,⠀contract,⠀or⠀system⠀actually⠀behaves⠀when⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀live⠀inside⠀it.\n\nShape⠀the⠀telling⠀with⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀official⠀answer⠀and⠀exposes⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀punishes⠀repayment,⠀a⠀security⠀protocol⠀that⠀rewards⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀breaks⠀it,⠀a⠀welfare⠀algorithm⠀that⠀treats⠀survival⠀as⠀fraud.⠀Keep⠀the⠀humor⠀dry⠀and⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀particular⠀voice.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀candid⠀about⠀its⠀own⠀omissions,⠀but⠀candor⠀is⠀not⠀full⠀disclosure;⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀openly⠀mock⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀while⠀quietly⠀protecting⠀another.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀objects,⠀or⠀gestures⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀embedded⠀account.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀tale⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀implication,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀mentioned⠀casually⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀pivot⠀of⠀the⠀embedded⠀story.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀was⠀actually⠀about,⠀show⠀that⠀recognition⠀changing⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀pay,⠀say,⠀or⠀do.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀and⠀intelligible.⠀Mark⠀the⠀shift⠀into⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀clearly,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀interruption.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished⠀if⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀demands⠀it;⠀an⠀unfinished⠀tale⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀a⠀bargaining⠀position.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀act⠀inside⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀performance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀as⠀an⠀administered⠀system⠀whose⠀procedures⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀relentless⠀logic.⠀Select⠀the⠀modernist-absurdist-satirical⠀route:⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀a⠀rule,⠀protocol,⠀or⠀corporate⠀policy⠀through⠀its⠀full⠀practical⠀consequences,⠀showing⠀how⠀each⠀step⠀is⠀reasonable⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms⠀and⠀absurd⠀in⠀combination.⠀The⠀pressure⠀comes⠀not⠀from⠀melodrama⠀but⠀from⠀the⠀system's⠀consistency.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀follows⠀the⠀rules⠀exactly⠀can⠀produce⠀a⠀worse⠀outcome⠀than⠀one⠀who⠀breaks⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀inversion⠀legible⠀without⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀to⠀puncture⠀the⠀solemn⠀language⠀of⠀the⠀system.⠀When⠀a⠀contract,⠀interface,⠀or⠀official⠀statement⠀makes⠀a⠀grand⠀claim,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀examine⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀requires⠀someone⠀to⠀do.⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀dry⠀and⠀precise:⠀a⠀euphemism⠀is⠀tested⠀against⠀the⠀body,⠀a⠀privacy⠀promise⠀is⠀tested⠀against⠀a⠀billing⠀record,⠀a⠀security⠀measure⠀is⠀tested⠀against⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀excludes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀owned⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀voice,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀narrator.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀angry,⠀amused,⠀tired,⠀or⠀genuinely⠀confused,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀remain⠀lucid⠀about⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀satirical⠀construction.⠀Favor⠀clean,⠀exact⠀sentences⠀that⠀state⠀an⠀official⠀position⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀concrete⠀detail⠀that⠀undermines⠀it.⠀Repetition⠀can⠀be⠀structural:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀or⠀procedure⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context⠀and⠀reveals⠀a⠀different⠀consequence.⠀Avoid⠀inflated⠀diction⠀and⠀portentous⠀atmosphere;⠀the⠀absurdity⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀material,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀insistence⠀that⠀everything⠀is⠀absurd.⠀When⠀the⠀system⠀observes,⠀prices,⠀or⠀excludes⠀someone,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀operation⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀it.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀cool⠀or⠀warm,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀precise⠀about⠀access,⠀cost,⠀and⠀control.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀inherited⠀authority⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀cyberpunk⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀a⠀costume.⠀An⠀old⠀family,⠀corporation,⠀guild,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀power⠀still⠀operates⠀through⠀current⠀systems:⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀key,⠀a⠀hereditary⠀contract⠀clause,⠀a⠀building⠀that⠀owns⠀its⠀residents⠀through⠀a⠀charter,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀clears⠀a⠀credit⠀check.⠀Show⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀that⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀in⠀concrete⠀urban⠀detail.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀a⠀familiar⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀a⠀private⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀terminal⠀can⠀feel⠀intimate,⠀threatening,⠀or⠀absurd⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀owe.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀to⠀strip⠀the⠀romance⠀from⠀the⠀old⠀order.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀invokes⠀tradition,⠀honor,⠀blood,⠀or⠀legacy,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀another⠀voice⠀ask⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀black⠀humor⠀is⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀people:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀mock⠀the⠀family⠀seal⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀fears⠀it.⠀Morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀belongs⠀here.⠀Desire,⠀loyalty,⠀resentment,⠀and⠀dependence⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀relationship,⠀and⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀Show⠀what⠀that⠀trust⠀costs⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀unmasked⠀person⠀actually⠀reveals.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀survives⠀because⠀it⠀controls⠀access,⠀debt,⠀or⠀information,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀inherently⠀majestic.⠀A⠀ritual⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀administrative⠀step,⠀a⠀secret⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀database⠀entry,⠀a⠀curse⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀collection⠀algorithm.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀faction⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀political:⠀someone⠀inherits⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀body⠀modification,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀role⠀they⠀never⠀chose.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀deepen⠀that⠀inquiry⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀recording⠀something⠀for⠀a⠀reason:⠀a⠀complaint,⠀a⠀claim,⠀a⠀record⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there,⠀a⠀statement⠀to⠀a⠀committee,⠀a⠀memory⠀preserved⠀against⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀would⠀erase⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀uses⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀language,⠀show⠀when⠀and⠀why;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀code-switching⠀or⠀English⠀as⠀a⠀default.⠀The⠀account⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀person,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀representative⠀of⠀a⠀community.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀personal⠀candor⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀testimony⠀direct⠀and⠀intellectually⠀independent.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer:⠀why⠀a⠀scheme⠀worked,⠀who⠀was⠀counted,⠀what⠀a⠀subsidy⠀actually⠀bought,⠀what⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀really⠀said.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀angry,⠀wry,⠀exhausted,⠀or⠀precise,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀perform⠀suffering⠀for⠀an⠀outside⠀audience.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀it⠀operated⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place:⠀a⠀welfare⠀biometric⠀that⠀failed⠀during⠀a⠀power⠀cut,⠀a⠀land⠀record⠀that⠀outlived⠀the⠀land,⠀a⠀loan⠀app⠀that⠀treated⠀a⠀festival⠀as⠀a⠀credit⠀risk.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀and⠀personal.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude⠀people⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀experience:⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning,⠀a⠀relative's⠀arrangement.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀witnessed⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀by⠀others.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀and⠀its⠀omissions⠀can⠀matter,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀should⠀remain⠀available.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀archive:⠀it⠀is⠀told⠀because⠀someone⠀needs⠀to⠀hear⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀consequences.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀narrator⠀and⠀a⠀loose⠀temporal⠀structure.⠀The⠀narrator⠀records⠀observations,⠀questions,⠀memories,⠀and⠀small⠀events⠀as⠀they⠀accumulate.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀appears⠀through⠀these⠀entries:⠀a⠀recurring⠀charge⠀on⠀an⠀account,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀changed⠀routine,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀fails⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀contract⠀that⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀context.⠀Let⠀the⠀entries⠀be⠀uneven⠀in⠀length⠀and⠀mood.⠀Some⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀records;⠀others⠀may⠀pause⠀to⠀argue⠀with⠀an⠀official⠀claim⠀or⠀to⠀examine⠀a⠀private⠀feeling.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀reflection.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀approved⠀answer⠀and⠀tests⠀solemn⠀language⠀against⠀concrete⠀experience.⠀A⠀diary⠀entry⠀can⠀begin⠀with⠀an⠀official⠀notice⠀and⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀it⠀implies.⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀dry⠀and⠀personal:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀mock⠀a⠀system's⠀politeness⠀while⠀still⠀depending⠀on⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀candor⠀owned⠀by⠀this⠀particular⠀voice.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀wise⠀or⠀consistent;⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀entries⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀mind⠀changing,⠀doubting,⠀or⠀refusing⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀conclusion.\n\nLet⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀work⠀as⠀method⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀A⠀detail⠀of⠀weather,⠀food,⠀or⠀routine⠀can⠀mark⠀time⠀and⠀register⠀pressure⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory.⠀Omission⠀is⠀meaningful:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀record⠀can⠀reveal⠀avoidance,⠀fear,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀should⠀remain⠀specific:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays,⠀what⠀is⠀observed,⠀what⠀is⠀excluded.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀document;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀private⠀practice⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀narrator's⠀independence⠀alive⠀inside⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀would⠀prefer⠀not⠀to⠀be⠀examined.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀chronicle⠀or⠀testimony⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀narrator⠀and⠀a⠀public⠀occasion.⠀The⠀narrator⠀records⠀conditions,⠀events,⠀and⠀voices⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀community,⠀neighborhood,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀migration⠀route.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀daily⠀economic⠀and⠀political⠀fact:⠀a⠀payment⠀network⠀that⠀excludes⠀certain⠀streets,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀contract⠀sold⠀to⠀a⠀housing⠀block,⠀a⠀labor⠀platform⠀that⠀reclassifies⠀workers,⠀a⠀clinic⠀that⠀prices⠀care⠀by⠀data⠀consent.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀place⠀and⠀time,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀setting.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀to⠀puncture⠀the⠀official⠀version.⠀When⠀a⠀company,⠀agency,⠀or⠀politician⠀announces⠀a⠀program,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀compare⠀the⠀announcement⠀with⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀experience.⠀The⠀humor⠀is⠀dry⠀and⠀grounded:⠀a⠀subsidy⠀that⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀discount⠀on⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀spies⠀on⠀the⠀household,⠀a⠀security⠀upgrade⠀that⠀locks⠀out⠀the⠀residents⠀it⠀claims⠀to⠀protect.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀a⠀compiler⠀of⠀others'⠀accounts,⠀but⠀the⠀perspective⠀should⠀remain⠀clear.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀reported,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀matter.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀and⠀collective.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude⠀people⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀queues,⠀forms,⠀debts,⠀devices,⠀and⠀negotiations.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀can⠀coexist:⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀accurate⠀than⠀a⠀terms-of-service⠀notice.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀the⠀world;⠀the⠀marvelous⠀is⠀not⠀required,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀precise⠀observation.⠀The⠀narration⠀is⠀an⠀intervention:⠀it⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀would⠀prefer⠀to⠀forget,⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀recording⠀has⠀consequences⠀for⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀the⠀community.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀concrete⠀cyberpunk⠀situation:⠀a⠀payment⠀being⠀refused,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀terms,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀reports⠀a⠀location.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do⠀within⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀sentences.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀someone⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀lobby⠀to⠀a⠀back⠀room,⠀make⠀the⠀transition⠀clear⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀new⠀space⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀remains⠀fast⠀and⠀legible.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀encounters⠀a⠀rule,⠀price,⠀or⠀official⠀claim,⠀let⠀them⠀reason⠀about⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀angry,⠀dry,⠀or⠀funny,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀particular⠀character.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀sharp⠀thought,⠀a⠀brief⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀response⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀understood.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀quippy;⠀let⠀the⠀humor⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀system,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀compulsory⠀banter⠀rhythm.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific⠀and⠀immediate.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision:⠀a⠀credit⠀check,⠀a⠀subscription,⠀a⠀data⠀consent,⠀a⠀bribe,⠀a⠀favor.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanic⠀or⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀in⠀context⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀forward.⠀The⠀light⠀novel⠀container⠀is⠀a⠀presentation⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀for⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀first⠀person,⠀or⠀comedy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀a⠀lyrical⠀passage⠀from⠀materials⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal's⠀repeated⠀chime,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀fragments⠀a⠀face⠀into⠀tiles,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀as⠀it⠀moves⠀from⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀a⠀precise⠀observation⠀about⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀account,⠀or⠀the⠀record.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀across⠀several⠀clauses⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present;⠀when⠀the⠀image⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work,⠀close⠀the⠀movement⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀or⠀the⠀cost.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀and⠀images⠀as⠀instruments⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀mood⠀alone.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀chime⠀that⠀announced⠀a⠀purchase⠀can⠀later⠀mark⠀a⠀denial⠀of⠀access.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀moving⠀through⠀shaped⠀imagery⠀toward⠀a⠀direct⠀statement⠀that⠀punctures⠀a⠀solemn⠀assumption.⠀The⠀lyricism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀associations⠀and⠀remains⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀other⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers⠀and⠀are⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀share⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀language.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀passage⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀even⠀when⠀memory⠀or⠀speculation⠀enters.⠀A⠀lyrical⠀description⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀window⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀window⠀is⠀being⠀scanned.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀infers⠀a⠀character's⠀motive,⠀ground⠀the⠀inference⠀in⠀an⠀observable⠀contradiction⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀the⠀imagery⠀alone.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀attention⠀remains⠀suspended,⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀developing⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀a⠀familiar⠀stall⠀now⠀closed,⠀a⠀contact's⠀voice⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀cheap⠀implant,⠀a⠀shortcut⠀blocked⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀checkpoint.⠀Attend⠀to⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association,⠀but⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable.⠀A⠀remembered⠀meal⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀place⠀that⠀served⠀it⠀is⠀gone.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀from⠀becoming⠀sentimental.⠀When⠀memory⠀turns⠀toward⠀the⠀past,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀who⠀now⠀controls⠀the⠀remembered⠀place,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀replacement,⠀or⠀which⠀rule⠀made⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀impossible.⠀The⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀regulation⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀genuine⠀longing⠀without⠀canceling⠀it.⠀Black⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀voices⠀and⠀particular⠀moments,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀recollection.\n\nA⠀reflection⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀answer,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀sharpen⠀attention⠀to⠀something⠀still⠀available.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀still⠀holding⠀both⠀the⠀memory⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀cost,⠀without⠀resolving⠀which⠀one⠀matters⠀more.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀route.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀narrator⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience:⠀a⠀fixer⠀explaining⠀a⠀job⠀to⠀a⠀newcomer,⠀a⠀repairer⠀recounting⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀history⠀while⠀working,⠀a⠀courier⠀passing⠀on⠀what⠀another⠀courier⠀said.⠀The⠀telling⠀itself⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀audience's⠀questions⠀or⠀interruptions⠀can⠀redirect⠀what⠀gets⠀explained,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀digression⠀that⠀later⠀proves⠀necessary.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀reveal⠀the⠀genre's⠀practical⠀conditions.⠀The⠀teller⠀knows⠀some⠀things⠀from⠀direct⠀participation⠀and⠀others⠀from⠀report,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀matters.⠀A⠀story⠀about⠀a⠀locked⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀now⠀paying⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀door⠀open.⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀the⠀audience:⠀someone⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀approved⠀answer⠀and⠀expose⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀quietly⠀assumes.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access,⠀debt,⠀or⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀believed⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀withheld.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀selected⠀tradition⠀distinct⠀and⠀avoid⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀or⠀mystical⠀convention.⠀The⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀remain⠀those⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story;⠀the⠀regional⠀route⠀changes⠀presentation⠀and⠀information⠀flow,⠀not⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀the⠀world's⠀facts.⠀A⠀later⠀detail⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀report,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀withhold⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀naturally⠀say⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀audience⠀still⠀listening,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀not⠀yet⠀given.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure.⠀One⠀detail⠀can⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access:⠀the⠀guard's⠀thumb⠀on⠀a⠀scanner,⠀the⠀price⠀displayed⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀entered,⠀the⠀missing⠀line⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀record.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀keep⠀only⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀causality;⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀enough⠀to⠀understand⠀why⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀commentary.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀directness⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀economy⠀itself.⠀A⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀assumption:⠀the⠀corporation⠀calls⠀it⠀a⠀security⠀measure,⠀the⠀narrator⠀calls⠀it⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀charge⠀for⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀serve⠀the⠀method⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀inference⠀more⠀economically⠀than⠀several⠀clipped⠀fragments.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀voice⠀individual;⠀minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀telegraphic⠀register.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀inward⠀connection⠀matters,⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀room⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀choice⠀in⠀three⠀sentences⠀rather⠀than⠀one.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀fact⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀available⠀options,⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀change⠀or⠀resolving⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀through⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀used⠀in⠀conversation⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀the⠀narrator⠀heard⠀it,⠀then⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀cost⠀of⠀accepting⠀it⠀as⠀normal.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀The⠀register⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene,⠀and⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀intellectual⠀independence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀fixed⠀noir⠀monotone.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀concrete.⠀When⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀it,⠀let⠀bargaining,⠀corporate⠀language,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀scenery.⠀A⠀negotiation⠀can⠀turn⠀on⠀who⠀can⠀afford⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀table.⠀A⠀recollection⠀can⠀clarify⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀now⠀accepts⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀absurd.⠀Let⠀each⠀movement⠀among⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀thought⠀contribute⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.\n\nPreserve⠀perspective⠀and⠀causal⠀interiority.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀cannot⠀enter⠀minds⠀excluded⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀composition,⠀with⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open.⠀No⠀lesson⠀or⠀completed⠀realization⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀its⠀particular⠀promise.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀actually⠀at⠀stake:⠀a⠀shared⠀account,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀owes⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀from⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀access⠀is⠀limited.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀they⠀belong,⠀but⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀inserting⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nLet⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀practical⠀conditions.⠀A⠀private⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀overheard⠀by⠀a⠀monitoring⠀system.⠀A⠀gesture⠀of⠀care⠀may⠀cost⠀money,⠀access,⠀or⠀exposure.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer⠀and⠀notice⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀treats⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀security⠀risk⠀or⠀a⠀market⠀segment.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀voices;⠀one⠀partner⠀may⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀moment⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀remains⠀sincere,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀perform⠀wit.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀decoration.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀should⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀between⠀these⠀people.⠀Preserve⠀perspective⠀and⠀interiority:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀still⠀developing⠀and⠀no⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀recurring⠀phrasing,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀the⠀genre's⠀concrete⠀material⠀as⠀the⠀substance⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀blocked⠀access⠀route⠀that⠀became⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀story,⠀a⠀bargain⠀whose⠀terms⠀are⠀still⠀repeated⠀differently.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀practical⠀candor.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀paying⠀for⠀the⠀door.⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀can⠀puncture⠀the⠀solemnity⠀of⠀the⠀retelling⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀interruption⠀into⠀parody.⠀A⠀remembered⠀act⠀may⠀be⠀praised⠀in⠀one⠀voice⠀and⠀explained⠀as⠀a⠀forced⠀compromise⠀in⠀another.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀the⠀act⠀was⠀free,⠀voluntary,⠀or⠀easy.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀relate⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀from⠀participation⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀from⠀report,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀matters.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀a⠀continuous⠀prose⠀narrator⠀observes⠀the⠀administered⠀spaces⠀where⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀actually⠀touch⠀ordinary⠀life—a⠀housing⠀registry,⠀a⠀workplace⠀access⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀debt-recovery⠀office,⠀a⠀transit⠀gate,⠀a⠀municipal⠀data⠀counter.⠀Treat⠀these⠀settings⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism,⠀not⠀futuristic⠀spectacle.⠀Describe⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀waiting⠀room,⠀the⠀clerk's⠀tone,⠀the⠀small⠀physical⠀objects⠀that⠀carry⠀authority,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀applied⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀domestic⠀consequence⠀of⠀each⠀institutional⠀encounter⠀remain⠀visible:⠀what⠀a⠀denied⠀application⠀means⠀for⠀a⠀household,⠀what⠀a⠀restructured⠀debt⠀changes⠀about⠀a⠀week's⠀meals,⠀what⠀an⠀access⠀failure⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀commute⠀or⠀a⠀child's⠀school⠀run.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer⠀in⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀manner.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀told⠀that⠀a⠀procedure⠀is⠀neutral,⠀efficient,⠀or⠀necessary,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀test⠀that⠀claim⠀by⠀placing⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀beside⠀the⠀observed⠀sequence⠀of⠀treatment:⠀who⠀waits⠀longer,⠀who⠀is⠀asked⠀for⠀extra⠀verification,⠀whose⠀file⠀opens⠀without⠀comment,⠀whose⠀debt⠀is⠀restructured⠀and⠀whose⠀is⠀not.⠀Let⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀accumulate⠀through⠀particular⠀cases⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀verdict.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀direct⠀and⠀nimble;⠀the⠀absurdity⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀precise⠀observation⠀of⠀the⠀rule's⠀practical⠀operation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀declares⠀everything⠀corrupt.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀ordinary⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀that⠀register⠀the⠀social⠀cost⠀of⠀these⠀encounters.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀phone,⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀the⠀effort⠀of⠀remaining⠀polite,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀visit,⠀or⠀the⠀small⠀calculation⠀of⠀what⠀an⠀extra⠀fee⠀will⠀displace⠀at⠀home.⠀These⠀inward⠀details⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀remain⠀unavailable⠀to⠀clerks,⠀officials,⠀or⠀companions⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀shown.⠀Let⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀sometimes⠀connect⠀the⠀institutional⠀moment⠀to⠀its⠀domestic⠀aftermath,⠀so⠀the⠀interiority⠀carries⠀the⠀social-realist⠀attention⠀to⠀consequence.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀story⠀involves⠀investigation,⠀bargaining,⠀or⠀debt,⠀make⠀the⠀institutional⠀mechanism⠀legible.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀learn⠀who⠀can⠀access⠀a⠀record,⠀what⠀a⠀late⠀fee⠀actually⠀triggers,⠀which⠀appeal⠀is⠀possible,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀supervisor⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀override.⠀The⠀pressure⠀comes⠀from⠀these⠀concrete⠀constraints,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀surveillance.⠀Let⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀bureaucratic⠀stalling,⠀and⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀help⠀all⠀remain⠀possible⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀situation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀lucid⠀and⠀composed.⠀Paragraphs⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀exterior⠀observation⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reflection,⠀but⠀the⠀reflection⠀should⠀remain⠀anchored⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Avoid⠀imported⠀Scandinavian⠀landscape⠀clichés⠀such⠀as⠀mandatory⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀silence.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Swedish,⠀or⠀Norwegian,⠀let⠀its⠀specific⠀institutional⠀and⠀social⠀details⠀shape⠀the⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀then⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀what⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀what⠀sound⠀comes⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀an⠀object.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀blocks⠀readable⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nLet⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀establish⠀the⠀observable⠀discrepancy⠀that⠀a⠀character's⠀line⠀can⠀then⠀puncture⠀in⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀manner.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀processed⠀without⠀question,⠀whose⠀screen⠀shows⠀an⠀error,⠀whose⠀file⠀requires⠀extra⠀verification,⠀whose⠀payment⠀is⠀accepted⠀and⠀whose⠀is⠀not.⠀Then⠀let⠀a⠀specific⠀character⠀restate⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀beside⠀that⠀visible⠀fact,⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀means,⠀or⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀screen⠀avoids⠀saying.⠀Keep⠀the⠀questioning⠀nimble⠀and⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀voices;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀engage,⠀and⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀concerned⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problem.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀memory⠀that⠀matters,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separated⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀Let⠀that⠀note⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀has⠀just⠀shown⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀the⠀focal⠀character—the⠀effort⠀of⠀remaining⠀polite,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀a⠀fee,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀visit⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀counter.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀material⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀visibly⠀shown.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀that⠀specific⠀device,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀every⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀visible⠀systems⠀and⠀choices.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀check⠀a⠀balance,⠀pass⠀a⠀scanner,⠀receive⠀a⠀payment⠀demand,⠀negotiate⠀access,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀door⠀no⠀longer⠀opens.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene's⠀information⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀transition⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀reversal⠀at⠀every⠀scene⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀stage⠀directions⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Use⠀objects⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure:⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀keycard,⠀a⠀file,⠀a⠀phone,⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀take⠀and⠀another⠀is⠀not.⠀Let⠀blocking⠀show⠀unequal⠀power⠀through⠀who⠀stands,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀hands⠀over⠀an⠀object,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀leave.\n\nLet⠀the⠀physical⠀arrangement⠀establish⠀the⠀observable⠀inequality⠀that⠀a⠀character's⠀line⠀can⠀then⠀test⠀in⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀manner.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀kept⠀standing⠀while⠀another⠀sits,⠀who⠀is⠀handed⠀a⠀form⠀without⠀comment,⠀whose⠀keycard⠀is⠀accepted⠀and⠀whose⠀is⠀not,⠀who⠀is⠀told⠀to⠀wait⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀admitted.⠀Then⠀let⠀a⠀specific⠀character⠀restate⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀beside⠀that⠀physical⠀fact,⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀means,⠀or⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀avoids⠀saying.⠀Keep⠀the⠀questioning⠀nimble⠀and⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀voices;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀satirist.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀engage,⠀and⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀concerned⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problem.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀required⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀memory,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀Let⠀that⠀material⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀staged⠀scene⠀has⠀just⠀shown⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀the⠀focal⠀character—the⠀effort⠀of⠀remaining⠀polite,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀a⠀fee,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀visit⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀counter.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀hear⠀that⠀material⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀actually⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀the⠀stage⠀space⠀make⠀proposed⠀actions⠀testable.⠀Who⠀can⠀reach⠀the⠀door,⠀see⠀the⠀screen,⠀hear⠀a⠀particular⠀line,⠀or⠀move⠀between⠀two⠀positions⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀physical⠀situation⠀constrains⠀what⠀is⠀plausible.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀an⠀entrance,⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀parties⠀at⠀every⠀scene⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀move⠀associatively⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀A⠀screen's⠀notification⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀debt⠀notice;⠀a⠀clerk's⠀phrase⠀may⠀summon⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀contract;⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀wet⠀sleeve⠀may⠀bring⠀back⠀a⠀previous⠀eviction.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer⠀in⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀manner.⠀When⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀recurs,⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀turn⠀it⠀over,⠀test⠀it⠀against⠀accumulated⠀remembered⠀instances,⠀and⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀wording⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.⠀The⠀same⠀promise⠀made⠀and⠀broken,⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀enforced⠀selectively,⠀the⠀same⠀reassurance⠀given⠀before⠀a⠀different⠀outcome—let⠀the⠀mind's⠀associative⠀return⠀to⠀these⠀instances⠀do⠀the⠀puncturing.⠀Keep⠀this⠀inquiry⠀direct⠀and⠀lucid⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀syntax⠀is⠀associative.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀should⠀be⠀discovered⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀movement,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀verdict.\n\nAnchor⠀recurring⠀concerns⠀in⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀that⠀actually⠀constrain⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀carry⠀temporal⠀pressure:⠀a⠀payment⠀schedule,⠀an⠀access⠀level,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀check,⠀a⠀medical⠀consent⠀form,⠀a⠀work⠀contract,⠀a⠀deadline⠀that⠀approaches⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀occupied⠀with⠀something⠀else.⠀These⠀concerns⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀pleasant⠀moment⠀or⠀surface⠀during⠀an⠀unrelated⠀task,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀remain⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀vague⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀dread.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀also⠀notice⠀ordinary⠀things⠀without⠀every⠀perception⠀becoming⠀a⠀sign⠀of⠀danger.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀and⠀other⠀characters.⠀Another⠀person's⠀motives⠀remain⠀unknown⠀except⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀do,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reasonably⠀infers.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀include⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀uncertainty,⠀suspicion,⠀or⠀correction⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀assumption.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀stream⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀wherever⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀naturally⠀pauses,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀forced⠀insight⠀or⠀completed⠀decision.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀surface⠀without⠀being⠀resolved,⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.⠀The⠀technique⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀difficulty⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Give⠀each⠀sender⠀a⠀distinct⠀digital⠀habit:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀sentences⠀and⠀checks⠀every⠀word,⠀another⠀sends⠀fragments⠀quickly,⠀a⠀third⠀leaves⠀messages⠀unread⠀for⠀hours,⠀a⠀fourth⠀edits⠀after⠀sending.⠀Let⠀these⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀message⠀serve⠀the⠀same⠀tone.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀story.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀may⠀matter⠀when⠀it⠀shows⠀that⠀someone⠀saw⠀a⠀request⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀answer.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀matter⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀particular⠀senders⠀carry⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀questioning⠀and⠀black⠀humor.⠀One⠀sender⠀may⠀quote⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice's⠀official⠀phrase⠀and⠀then⠀restate⠀in⠀plain⠀words⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀requires,⠀permits,⠀or⠀excludes.⠀Another⠀may⠀ask⠀why⠀a⠀deadline⠀applies⠀to⠀them⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀transcript's⠀visible⠀record—who⠀is⠀answered,⠀who⠀is⠀not,⠀whose⠀attachment⠀is⠀blocked—carry⠀the⠀implication.⠀Another⠀may⠀send⠀no⠀comment⠀at⠀all.⠀Keep⠀the⠀candor⠀owned⠀by⠀specific⠀voices;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sender⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀whom,⠀which⠀channel⠀is⠀monitored,⠀whose⠀message⠀is⠀answered,⠀whose⠀attachment⠀is⠀blocked,⠀what⠀a⠀payment⠀demand⠀says,⠀what⠀a⠀supervisor⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀put⠀in⠀writing.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀received⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀party.\n\nWhen⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀chat⠀to⠀check⠀a⠀door,⠀make⠀a⠀call,⠀or⠀read⠀a⠀paper⠀notice;⠀that⠀action⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀surrounding⠀story,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀transmitted⠀messages.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reply⠀or⠀a⠀resolution⠀at⠀every⠀exchange⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀units⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Open⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀that⠀establishes⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀hear.⠀Then⠀move⠀between⠀readable⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Keep⠀the⠀rhythm⠀varied:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀short⠀reaction,⠀a⠀longer⠀reflection,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀without⠀any⠀interior⠀beat.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀carry⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀precise⠀puncturing⠀of⠀solemn⠀assumptions⠀by⠀working⠀against⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀details.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀a⠀screen⠀presents⠀an⠀official⠀phrase,⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀background⠀shows,⠀what⠀the⠀screen⠀displays,⠀what⠀the⠀expression⠀cue⠀accompanies,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀phrase⠀avoids⠀saying⠀about⠀those⠀visible⠀facts.⠀The⠀clean⠀office⠀may⠀indicate⠀authority⠀or⠀a⠀cleaning⠀schedule,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀can⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀office's⠀orderliness⠀permits⠀or⠀excludes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀direct⠀and⠀specific.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀focal⠀reaction⠀sardonic.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀for⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀character's⠀tired⠀expression⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀lie⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀truth;⠀a⠀clean⠀office⠀may⠀indicate⠀authority⠀or⠀merely⠀a⠀cleaning⠀schedule.⠀Let⠀contradictions⠀in⠀accounts,⠀arrangements,⠀or⠀visible⠀facts⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀involves⠀investigation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀concrete⠀systems⠀and⠀choices.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀check⠀a⠀balance,⠀wait⠀for⠀access,⠀notice⠀who⠀is⠀admitted⠀without⠀question,⠀or⠀realize⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀service⠀will⠀cost.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene's⠀information⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀open.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀remains⠀private⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀an⠀installment,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀that⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀immediate⠀constraint⠀or⠀obligation⠀applies.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀entire⠀investigation⠀or⠀relationship⠀history.\n\nGive⠀each⠀installment⠀a⠀local⠀question⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀system⠀change⠀that⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀test⠀in⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀manner.⠀A⠀new⠀rule,⠀a⠀restructured⠀payment,⠀an⠀access⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀reassurance⠀may⠀prompt⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀actually⠀permits,⠀why⠀it⠀applies⠀to⠀some⠀people⠀and⠀not⠀others,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀leaves⠀out.⠀Follow⠀that⠀question⠀through⠀the⠀installment's⠀scenes⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀fully⠀answered.⠀The⠀question⠀may⠀be⠀complicated⠀by⠀new⠀information,⠀set⠀aside⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀or⠀returned⠀to⠀later.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀develop⠀cumulatively.⠀A⠀debt⠀may⠀accrue⠀interest,⠀an⠀access⠀level⠀may⠀change,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀check⠀may⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀record,⠀a⠀contact⠀may⠀become⠀harder⠀to⠀reach.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀fact⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀again,⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀New⠀information⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀old⠀event.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀also⠀develop:⠀an⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀may⠀be⠀revised⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact,⠀and⠀the⠀serial⠀form⠀should⠀let⠀that⠀revision⠀happen⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀deliberately⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀decision,⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀bargain,⠀or⠀reason⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀new⠀offer⠀would⠀cost.⠀These⠀private⠀details⠀remain⠀unavailable⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀condition,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀question⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLocate⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀point⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀exchange⠀where⠀one⠀character⠀needs⠀something⠀from⠀another:⠀access,⠀money,⠀a⠀favor,⠀a⠀location,⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀return.⠀Make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀need⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀that⠀governs⠀it.⠀A⠀request⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀building⠀becomes⠀a⠀logged⠀identity⠀and⠀a⠀debt;⠀a⠀plea⠀to⠀stay⠀becomes⠀a⠀shared⠀location⠀and⠀a⠀camera⠀angle;⠀an⠀apology⠀becomes⠀a⠀payment⠀confirmation⠀that⠀dims⠀before⠀it⠀clears.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀of⠀that⠀cost,⠀and⠀place⠀them⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀cost⠀is⠀incurred⠀or⠀refused.⠀The⠀smudge⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀transfer⠀fails;⠀the⠀lag⠀before⠀the⠀door⠀unlocks⠀follows⠀the⠀withheld⠀answer;⠀the⠀particular⠀stillness⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀stopped⠀arguing⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀surveillance⠀flag⠀is⠀noticed.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀connection.⠀Let⠀the⠀detail⠀return⠀once⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀since.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀subsequent⠀behavior.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀too⠀much,⠀have⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀or⠀movement⠀show⠀the⠀consequence:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀camera,⠀the⠀speaker⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀payment⠀pad,⠀the⠀room's⠀silence⠀changes.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀the⠀one⠀thing⠀that⠀matters,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀withholding⠀costs⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn,⠀a⠀chair⠀pushed⠀back,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀Comfort,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀should⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀hard,⠀a⠀blanket⠀offered⠀without⠀meeting⠀the⠀eyes,⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀and⠀then⠀edited⠀after⠀sending.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience⠀present⠀but⠀selective.⠀Between⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀give⠀a⠀short⠀interval⠀of⠀private⠀attention:⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀a⠀sudden⠀awareness⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀also⠀being⠀watched.⠀Let⠀that⠀interval⠀feed⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀move⠀rather⠀than⠀stand⠀as⠀a⠀detached⠀summary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unresolved,⠀the⠀debt⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀or⠀the⠀surveillance⠀still⠀running,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀state⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀each⠀response⠀inside⠀a⠀definite⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀exchange,⠀with⠀speakers⠀attributed⠀unmistakably⠀and⠀positions⠀clear⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀answer⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀system⠀or⠀obligation⠀is⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀interval:⠀a⠀door⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀code,⠀a⠀payment⠀pad⠀lit⠀on⠀the⠀counter,⠀a⠀transit⠀car⠀passing⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀unread.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀from⠀that⠀active⠀pressure⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀orient⠀the⠀moment.⠀Choose⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀access⠀or⠀cost⠀actually⠀in⠀play:⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀the⠀notification⠀light⠀when⠀a⠀transfer⠀is⠀refused,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀strap⠀when⠀someone⠀is⠀followed,⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀two⠀people⠀when⠀a⠀camera⠀covers⠀the⠀doorway.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀detail⠀means.⠀Let⠀it⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀can⠀notice⠀it⠀and⠀respond.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀active⠀through⠀concrete⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀balance,⠀have⠀the⠀result⠀affect⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀camera⠀angle,⠀have⠀them⠀adjust⠀a⠀movement⠀or⠀a⠀sentence.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀bargains⠀for⠀a⠀favor,⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀logged,⠀shared,⠀or⠀withheld⠀in⠀the⠀bargain.⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives:⠀a⠀clerk⠀processes⠀the⠀payment,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀watches⠀the⠀hallway,⠀a⠀contact⠀asks⠀for⠀the⠀location⠀before⠀answering.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀visible⠀move.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀a⠀character's⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀an⠀action⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings⠀throughout.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Establish⠀the⠀particular⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀network⠀as⠀the⠀unit⠀of⠀observation,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀its⠀practical⠀arrangements.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀that⠀community⠀actually⠀shares⠀and⠀owes:⠀a⠀family⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀spending⠀limit,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀monitoring⠀package,⠀a⠀shop's⠀credit⠀line,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀watches⠀the⠀hallway⠀cameras,⠀a⠀relative⠀whose⠀debt⠀changes⠀the⠀household's⠀choices.\n\nRender⠀those⠀arrangements⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanation.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀arrangement⠀in⠀play⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀The⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀card⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀family⠀account⠀is⠀discussed;⠀the⠀particular⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀being⠀locked⠀from⠀outside⠀follows⠀a⠀landlord's⠀notice;⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀bowl⠀is⠀set⠀down⠀after⠀a⠀difficult⠀call⠀marks⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀accepted.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀the⠀details⠀suggest⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀cannot⠀say⠀directly.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀daily⠀negotiations.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀concrete⠀exchanges:⠀a⠀favor⠀requested⠀from⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀watches⠀the⠀cameras,⠀a⠀bill⠀deferred⠀at⠀the⠀shop,⠀a⠀location⠀shared⠀with⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀household.⠀Let⠀each⠀exchange⠀reveal⠀the⠀network's⠀obligations⠀and⠀strains⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀characters⠀into⠀fixed⠀social⠀types.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀community's⠀language⠀and⠀habits⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀period.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀speech⠀patterns,⠀domestic⠀customs,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀structures⠀from⠀another⠀region.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀unresolved,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀systems⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀relationships⠀have⠀been⠀made⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀between⠀concrete⠀physical⠀details,⠀but⠀divide⠀them⠀by⠀function.⠀The⠀functional⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀action:⠀a⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀a⠀wet⠀cuff,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀burned⠀connector,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀in⠀a⠀pocket.⠀Reserve⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀selected⠀impressions⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight,⠀and⠀place⠀them⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀cost⠀is⠀incurred⠀or⠀refused.⠀The⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀shoulder⠀appears⠀after⠀the⠀long⠀watch⠀ends⠀without⠀payment;⠀the⠀cold⠀stairwell⠀becomes⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀realizes⠀the⠀door⠀will⠀not⠀open.\n\nLet⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀ground⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀equipment:⠀a⠀favor⠀logged⠀against⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀patch⠀of⠀skin⠀numbed⠀for⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀device⠀traded⠀away⠀for⠀passage,⠀a⠀night⠀spent⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell⠀because⠀the⠀account⠀was⠀frozen.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀should⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them,⠀spoken⠀by⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀them.\n\nRetain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀transitions⠀tight.⠀Use⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀to⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀pressure:⠀a⠀sudden⠀short⠀sentence⠀after⠀a⠀longer⠀observation,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀physical⠀action,⠀a⠀single⠀hard⠀word⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀decides.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀gritty⠀surface⠀erase⠀the⠀author's⠀selective⠀attention.⠀The⠀details⠀should⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀through⠀their⠀relation:⠀the⠀wet⠀cuff⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀burned⠀connector,⠀the⠀numbed⠀patch⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀scan⠀it⠀bought.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀freeze⠀them⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀transaction⠀requires:⠀a⠀message⠀asking⠀for⠀access,⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀after⠀a⠀door⠀opened,⠀a⠀log⠀generated⠀by⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there,⠀a⠀claim⠀submitted⠀to⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀will⠀read⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document's⠀author⠀select⠀details⠀according⠀to⠀Kawabata's⠀method.⠀The⠀document⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀needs⠀to⠀record⠀for⠀the⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀omits⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀cannot⠀or⠀will⠀not⠀say.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀mention⠀only⠀the⠀smudge⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀and⠀omit⠀the⠀argument⠀that⠀caused⠀it.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀it.⠀A⠀receipt⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀amount⠀paid⠀but⠀not⠀what⠀was⠀traded⠀away⠀to⠀raise⠀it.⠀What⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follows⠀its⠀author's⠀situation,⠀relationship,⠀and⠀purpose.\n\nMake⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀document⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀revises⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀let⠀the⠀revision⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀author⠀left⠀out.⠀When⠀two⠀accounts⠀conflict,⠀let⠀the⠀conflict⠀point⠀to⠀the⠀pressure⠀each⠀author⠀faced:⠀a⠀debt⠀logged⠀differently,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀flag⠀omitted,⠀a⠀payment⠀deferred⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀between⠀entries⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀practical⠀context.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀record:⠀an⠀access⠀request⠀denied,⠀a⠀credit⠀line⠀reduced,⠀a⠀location⠀shared⠀under⠀a⠀system's⠀terms,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept⠀because⠀the⠀record⠀would⠀be⠀read.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀document⠀unfinished⠀or⠀unsent,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀its⠀composition⠀remains⠀a⠀concrete⠀artifact⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author⠀and⠀purpose,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures,⠀but⠀tie⠀each⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀to⠀the⠀access⠀or⠀cost⠀already⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀meal⠀is⠀saved⠀because⠀the⠀account⠀will⠀not⠀cover⠀another;⠀a⠀device⠀is⠀charged⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀checkpoint;⠀a⠀blanket⠀is⠀brought⠀because⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀cold⠀and⠀the⠀heat⠀is⠀metered;⠀a⠀route⠀is⠀chosen⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀camera⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀a⠀few⠀minutes⠀unwatched.⠀The⠀comfort⠀responds⠀to⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀ignoring⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀concrete⠀and⠀transient.⠀Choose⠀one⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀affection:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀passed⠀across⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀arranges⠀a⠀cord⠀so⠀it⠀will⠀not⠀tangle,⠀the⠀brief⠀quiet⠀after⠀a⠀door⠀closes⠀and⠀the⠀camera⠀light⠀stays⠀dark.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀the⠀details⠀suggest⠀the⠀care.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀present⠀without⠀letting⠀it⠀cancel⠀the⠀comfort.⠀A⠀small⠀pleasure⠀may⠀cost⠀a⠀credit;⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀payment⠀alert;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀may⠀take⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀camera.⠀Show⠀the⠀pressure⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀the⠀balance⠀on⠀the⠀screen,⠀the⠀alert⠀that⠀dims⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀camera⠀angle⠀that⠀covers⠀the⠀corner.⠀The⠀warmth⠀remains⠀sincere⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀system⠀is⠀still⠀running.\n\nPreserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀awkwardly,⠀refuse⠀it⠀once,⠀or⠀offer⠀it⠀without⠀meeting⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀eyes.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀warmth⠀still⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀pressure⠀still⠀running,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀affection⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Choose⠀the⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀that⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀access,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀frame⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀changed⠀character⠀after⠀a⠀company⠀bought⠀the⠀block,⠀a⠀family's⠀long⠀debt⠀to⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀public⠀promise⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀private⠀burden,⠀a⠀workplace⠀where⠀everyone⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀watched.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀prose⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀or⠀archaic.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀enter⠀through⠀that⠀social⠀context's⠀specific⠀institutions⠀and⠀obligations.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀observation⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀system⠀prices⠀a⠀choice,⠀how⠀a⠀camera⠀changes⠀a⠀public⠀space,⠀how⠀a⠀debt⠀shapes⠀a⠀family's⠀options,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀company's⠀reputation⠀determines⠀who⠀is⠀believed.⠀Keep⠀these⠀observations⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀arrangements⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀policy⠀summary.\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀of⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions.⠀The⠀particular⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀wet⠀street⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀considers⠀the⠀neighborhood's⠀change;⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀public⠀bench⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀decision;⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character's⠀hand⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀railing⠀appears⠀when⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀mentioned.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀the⠀details⠀suggest⠀what⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀cannot⠀say⠀directly.\n\nUse⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀to⠀organize⠀the⠀observations,⠀not⠀to⠀replace⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀with⠀commentary.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀judge,⠀but⠀the⠀judgment⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀details⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀situation.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀still⠀pressing⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀still⠀unresolved,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀live⠀interval⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀occurs:⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀locked⠀transit⠀car,⠀a⠀back⠀office,⠀a⠀call⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀ended.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀stake⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀watch,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀interrupt—a⠀hand⠀kept⠀near⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀question⠀repeated⠀about⠀who⠀authorized⠀the⠀delay,⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀keep⠀closed.⠀The⠀teller's⠀purpose⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced;⠀let⠀it⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀selects,⠀softens,⠀or⠀leaves⠀out.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀as⠀a⠀compressed⠀recollection⠀built⠀from⠀brief⠀sensory⠀surfaces⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀case⠀history.⠀Choose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀physical⠀impressions—a⠀door's⠀changed⠀lock,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀screen,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀device,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀scar⠀or⠀graft—and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀of⠀access,⠀debt,⠀or⠀surveillance.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection⠀between⠀these⠀details.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀say,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀would⠀punish.⠀Keep⠀those⠀omissions⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀detail⠀returned⠀to⠀without⠀resolution,⠀a⠀motive⠀stated⠀too⠀cleanly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀reinterpret⠀the⠀tale.⠀Their⠀interruptions⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀concrete⠀matters⠀of⠀access,⠀payment,⠀timing,⠀or⠀who⠀authorized⠀an⠀action.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object—a⠀passcode,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause,⠀a⠀damaged⠀implant,⠀a⠀street⠀name—can⠀recur⠀across⠀the⠀outer⠀and⠀embedded⠀levels,⠀accumulating⠀meaning⠀without⠀certifying⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.⠀When⠀the⠀tale⠀ends,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀negotiation:⠀a⠀delay⠀achieved,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀sharpened,⠀a⠀sympathy⠀withdrawn,⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀now⠀willing⠀to⠀act.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀persuade⠀without⠀being⠀fully⠀honest,⠀and⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀see.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀during⠀the⠀recounted⠀events⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀retroactively⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Keep⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀not⠀in⠀mandatory⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀or⠀slang.⠀The⠀embedded⠀tale⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀solve⠀a⠀mystery⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀checkable⠀lead;⠀its⠀function⠀is⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀relationship⠀and⠀its⠀terms.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀its⠀immediate⠀effect⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀outer⠀negotiation⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Enter⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀already⠀holding⠀or⠀pursuing⠀a⠀specific⠀record—a⠀contract⠀file,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀medical⠀or⠀credit⠀history,⠀a⠀corporate⠀archive,⠀a⠀public⠀registry—and⠀let⠀the⠀comparison⠀with⠀remembered⠀conditions⠀begin⠀immediately.⠀Quote⠀or⠀summarize⠀the⠀record's⠀language⠀when⠀it⠀matters:⠀its⠀categories,⠀timestamps,⠀fees,⠀authorizations,⠀exclusions.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀become⠀a⠀list;⠀after⠀each⠀record,⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀brief⠀sensory⠀memory⠀selected⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner—the⠀cold⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀terminal,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀sealed⠀corridor,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀person's⠀hand⠀hesitated⠀over⠀a⠀payment.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀cannot⠀show.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection⠀between⠀the⠀document⠀and⠀the⠀memory;⠀the⠀relation⠀itself⠀can⠀remain⠀partially⠀unspoken.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀someone⠀reconstructing⠀another⠀person's⠀history⠀from⠀incomplete⠀access.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀know⠀from⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀only⠀from⠀memory⠀or⠀hearsay.⠀A⠀document⠀can⠀confirm⠀a⠀date⠀without⠀confirming⠀a⠀motive;⠀a⠀memory⠀can⠀be⠀vivid⠀without⠀being⠀accurate.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀this⠀difference,⠀let⠀it⠀produce⠀unease,⠀grief,⠀or⠀suspicion⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lecture⠀about⠀surveillance.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀stakes⠀emerge⠀through⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀archive⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀access.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀sealed,⠀altered,⠀priced,⠀or⠀available⠀only⠀through⠀a⠀favor.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attempt⠀to⠀retrieve⠀or⠀interpret⠀it⠀can⠀involve⠀debt,⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀or⠀institutional⠀language.⠀Keep⠀those⠀pressures⠀present⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀chase⠀or⠀a⠀confrontation⠀in⠀every⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unverified⠀record⠀against⠀an⠀unresolved⠀memory,⠀provided⠀the⠀comparison⠀has⠀advanced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀inside⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀claim,⠀a⠀legacy⠀contract,⠀a⠀building's⠀original⠀owner,⠀a⠀guild⠀or⠀clan⠀privilege,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited⠀across⠀generations.⠀The⠀present⠀life⠀is⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀system⠀that⠀now⠀enforces,⠀prices,⠀or⠀undermines⠀that⠀authority:⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀bloodline,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀watching⠀a⠀private⠀room,⠀an⠀algorithm⠀that⠀recalculates⠀an⠀old⠀obligation,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀where⠀decay⠀and⠀new⠀construction⠀overlap.⠀Let⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀surface⠀through⠀present⠀enforcement⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition—a⠀character⠀learns⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀claim⠀means⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀now⠀charges,⠀denies,⠀or⠀records.\n\nRender⠀the⠀collision⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀encounter—a⠀worn⠀emblem⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀access⠀panel,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wood⠀behind⠀a⠀filtration⠀unit,⠀a⠀hand's⠀tremor⠀when⠀passing⠀a⠀scanner,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀door⠀recognizes⠀someone⠀it⠀should⠀not.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀full⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀or⠀the⠀system;⠀let⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀reveal⠀enough⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀notice⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀saying.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀trust⠀someone⠀whose⠀access⠀they⠀depend⠀on,⠀desire⠀someone⠀whose⠀loyalty⠀is⠀compromised,⠀or⠀protect⠀someone⠀whose⠀claim⠀is⠀fraudulent.⠀Social⠀masks⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀trust⠀itself⠀may⠀be⠀observed,⠀priced,⠀or⠀used.⠀Write⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀as⠀real⠀and⠀vulnerable⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀a⠀trap.⠀The⠀horror⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀want⠀to⠀keep⠀private⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀systems⠀around⠀them⠀can⠀see,⠀charge,⠀or⠀revoke.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀it.⠀A⠀room's⠀decay,⠀a⠀building's⠀history,⠀or⠀a⠀device's⠀age⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀fear,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀remember.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀noir⠀stakes⠀remain⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀encounter⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—a⠀mask⠀lowered,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀door⠀closed—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀bargain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀present⠀moment⠀of⠀telling:⠀the⠀narrator⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀recovering⠀from⠀a⠀procedure,⠀sitting⠀in⠀a⠀borrowed⠀room,⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀once⠀left.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀stake⠀shape⠀the⠀account⠀from⠀the⠀start—the⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀speaking⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀can⠀help,⠀to⠀a⠀stranger,⠀to⠀a⠀machine,⠀or⠀to⠀themselves.⠀The⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀has⠀a⠀present⠀purpose:⠀to⠀persuade,⠀to⠀record,⠀to⠀confess,⠀to⠀delay,⠀or⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀happened.⠀That⠀purpose⠀shapes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀includes⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀selection⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.\n\nMove⠀between⠀that⠀present⠀and⠀remembered⠀events.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀debt⠀they⠀inherited,⠀a⠀job⠀they⠀lost⠀when⠀an⠀algorithm⠀reclassified⠀them,⠀a⠀body⠀modification⠀they⠀accepted⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀whose⠀access⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀helped⠀or⠀betrayed⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀generalize⠀about⠀the⠀system.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀specific⠀choices,⠀compromises,⠀and⠀costs⠀carry⠀the⠀critique.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀now;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀telling⠀but⠀cannot⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nSelect⠀sensory⠀details⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner.⠀Instead⠀of⠀listing⠀every⠀hardship,⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions⠀per⠀remembered⠀scene:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀card⠀worn⠀smooth,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀sealing,⠀the⠀particular⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀crowded⠀transit⠀car,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀water⠀from⠀a⠀tap⠀that⠀still⠀worked.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀hold⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀Omit⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀bear⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀understand,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀omission⠀be⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀telling—a⠀sentence⠀that⠀stops⠀short,⠀a⠀name⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀role,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀described⠀without⠀its⠀meaning⠀explained.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀stakes⠀remain⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀questioned,⠀or⠀received⠀with⠀indifference;⠀the⠀audience's⠀response⠀can⠀return⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀testimony⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀narrator's⠀situation⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Compose⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀dated⠀or⠀clearly⠀separated⠀personal⠀entries⠀written⠀by⠀a⠀character⠀living⠀inside⠀cyberpunk-noir's⠀systems⠀of⠀observation,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀access.⠀Open⠀each⠀entry⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀for⠀writing:⠀a⠀payment⠀notice⠀arrived,⠀a⠀scan⠀failed,⠀a⠀person⠀stopped⠀answering,⠀a⠀rumor⠀changed⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀building,⠀or⠀the⠀diarist⠀simply⠀needed⠀to⠀set⠀down⠀what⠀the⠀day⠀left⠀behind.⠀The⠀entries⠀need⠀not⠀form⠀a⠀continuous⠀narrative;⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀fragments,⠀observations,⠀memories,⠀or⠀brief⠀reflections⠀written⠀at⠀different⠀times⠀and⠀under⠀different⠀pressures.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀entry⠀selective⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner.⠀Let⠀the⠀diarist⠀record⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions—the⠀way⠀a⠀surveillance⠀drone's⠀shadow⠀crossed⠀a⠀windowsill,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀notice⠀in⠀their⠀hand,⠀the⠀fading⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀door,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀connection⠀dropped—and⠀let⠀those⠀details⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀The⠀diarist⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀why⠀they⠀noticed⠀something⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀omission⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀form:⠀a⠀person⠀writing⠀for⠀themselves⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀every⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀recording.⠀They⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀debt's⠀new⠀interest⠀rate,⠀a⠀biometric⠀scan⠀that⠀failed,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀disappeared,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀stopped⠀answering.⠀They⠀may⠀also⠀leave⠀gaps⠀where⠀the⠀entry⠀breaks⠀off,⠀where⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀too⠀dangerous⠀to⠀write,⠀or⠀where⠀the⠀diarist⠀simply⠀cannot⠀face⠀the⠀day's⠀event.⠀Enact⠀these⠀gaps⠀in⠀the⠀prose—a⠀sentence⠀that⠀stops⠀short,⠀a⠀name⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀role,⠀an⠀entry⠀that⠀ends⠀before⠀the⠀event⠀it⠀approaches—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀their⠀meaning.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀diarist's⠀limited⠀knowledge.⠀They⠀know⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀remembered,⠀or⠀been⠀told.⠀They⠀may⠀speculate,⠀but⠀their⠀speculation⠀is⠀not⠀fact.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀correct⠀or⠀complicate⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀retroactively⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀entries⠀accumulate⠀into⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀life⠀under⠀observation⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀resolution.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀an⠀entry⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀close,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀diarist's⠀situation⠀remains⠀uncertain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀in⠀motion⠀toward⠀a⠀concrete⠀goal:⠀paying⠀a⠀debt,⠀passing⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀reaching⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀or⠀avoiding⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀has⠀flagged⠀them.⠀The⠀city⠀is⠀not⠀scenery;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀choices.⠀A⠀street⠀may⠀be⠀closed⠀by⠀a⠀credit⠀threshold,⠀a⠀building⠀may⠀recognize⠀some⠀bodies⠀and⠀not⠀others,⠀a⠀public⠀screen⠀may⠀display⠀a⠀debt⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀escape,⠀a⠀transit⠀gate⠀may⠀demand⠀a⠀scan⠀the⠀character⠀fears.⠀Let⠀these⠀conditions⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀pass,⠀pay,⠀or⠀avoid⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀city.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀psychological⠀focus⠀close⠀and⠀selective⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀avoids,⠀not⠀report⠀every⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀city.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀impressions⠀per⠀scene—the⠀particular⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀crowded⠀platform,⠀the⠀flicker⠀of⠀a⠀malfunctioning⠀advertisement,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀hot⠀metal,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀handrail—and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀emotional⠀state.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection⠀between⠀the⠀impression⠀and⠀the⠀feeling.⠀The⠀character's⠀attention⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀something⠀small⠀while⠀a⠀larger⠀threat⠀remains⠀unspoken.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀situation.⠀Their⠀choices⠀are⠀compromised⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀who⠀they⠀know,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀give⠀up.⠀Write⠀those⠀compromises⠀as⠀real⠀decisions⠀with⠀costs,⠀not⠀as⠀abstract⠀despair.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀act,⠀hesitate,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀refuse,⠀and⠀each⠀choice⠀has⠀consequences⠀within⠀the⠀scene.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀character's⠀limited⠀knowledge⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀reasons⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀perfectly⠀perceptive.⠀They⠀may⠀misinterpret⠀a⠀gesture,⠀miss⠀an⠀implication,⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀only⠀after⠀it⠀is⠀too⠀late.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀opaque⠀except⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀observes⠀and⠀infers.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀movement⠀or⠀attention⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—a⠀gate⠀passed,⠀a⠀message⠀read,⠀a⠀decision⠀postponed—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀inside⠀the⠀immediate⠀pressure:⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀ahead,⠀a⠀message⠀they⠀cannot⠀ignore,⠀a⠀favor⠀they⠀need⠀to⠀call⠀in.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀movement,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀separate⠀setup⠀paragraph.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀lobby,⠀from⠀a⠀terminal⠀to⠀a⠀back⠀room,⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀space⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀one,⠀mark⠀the⠀transition⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀physical⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀while⠀moving—the⠀change⠀in⠀light,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lock⠀engaging—and⠀a⠀paragraph⠀break.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀act,⠀speak,⠀and⠀then⠀react⠀in⠀a⠀focused⠀beat.⠀Write⠀the⠀reaction⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner:⠀a⠀brief⠀sensory⠀impression⠀or⠀a⠀compressed⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀explanation.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀cold⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀counter,⠀the⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀debt⠀collector's⠀voice⠀softens,⠀the⠀afterimage⠀of⠀a⠀screen's⠀warning.⠀Let⠀that⠀detail⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection⠀between⠀the⠀impression⠀and⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀noir⠀stakes⠀concrete.⠀The⠀character's⠀choices⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀give⠀up.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀involve⠀bargaining⠀over⠀a⠀fee,⠀passing⠀a⠀biometric⠀check,⠀accepting⠀a⠀modification,⠀or⠀lying⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀truth.⠀Write⠀the⠀compromise⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀decision⠀with⠀a⠀cost,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀generic⠀mood.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀frightened,⠀angry,⠀resigned,⠀or⠀quietly⠀determined;⠀the⠀reaction⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀them,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀fixed⠀emotional⠀template.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀character's⠀limited⠀knowledge.⠀They⠀know⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀and⠀inferred.⠀They⠀may⠀be⠀wrong.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀motives⠀remain⠀visible⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀observes.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀appear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀payment⠀clears,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀wait—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀lyric⠀sentence⠀follow⠀the⠀path⠀of⠀access⠀and⠀payment.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀fact⠀about⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀clearance,⠀or⠀a⠀body,⠀then⠀extend⠀the⠀sentence⠀into⠀a⠀sensory⠀image⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀that⠀control.⠀A⠀debt⠀collector's⠀patience⠀can⠀be⠀like⠀a⠀waiting⠀queue⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀comparison⠀reveals⠀something⠀about⠀waiting,⠀cost,⠀or⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀people⠀are⠀processed.⠀Keep⠀each⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀statements⠀interrupt⠀the⠀figurative⠀passages⠀so⠀the⠀pressure⠀remains⠀practical⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀precise⠀surface⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀system⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀recur⠀with⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀register.⠀The⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀access⠀card,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀rented⠀terminal,⠀the⠀shadow⠀of⠀a⠀surveillance⠀drone⠀crossing⠀a⠀windowsill,⠀the⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀payment⠀notification⠀arrives:⠀such⠀a⠀detail⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀under⠀different⠀light,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling⠀that⠀an⠀explicit⠀statement⠀would⠀flatten.⠀When⠀the⠀surface⠀recurs,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀itself⠀register⠀the⠀change.⠀A⠀sentence⠀that⠀first⠀moved⠀quickly⠀through⠀a⠀scan⠀may⠀later⠀slow⠀around⠀the⠀same⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀first⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀working⠀device⠀may⠀return⠀for⠀one⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀responds.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀where⠀the⠀system⠀withholds⠀information.⠀A⠀significant⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀fact—a⠀cup⠀left⠀cooling,⠀a⠀screen⠀returning⠀to⠀its⠀default⠀balance,⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀after⠀the⠀credit⠀check⠀fails—rather⠀than⠀by⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀event⠀meant.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀can⠀shift⠀to⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep,⠀and⠀that⠀shift⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀more⠀precisely⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀emotion.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register;⠀their⠀dialogue⠀may⠀remain⠀plain,⠀practical,⠀or⠀evasive,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀sharpens⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀them.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀grant⠀itself⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀excludes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀reflection⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀system⠀change.⠀A⠀revoked⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀replaced⠀implant,⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀answers,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀whose⠀public⠀terminal⠀has⠀been⠀removed:⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀the⠀present⠀fact⠀first,⠀then⠀lets⠀it⠀open⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀fact⠀now⠀reads⠀as⠀loss⠀or⠀relief.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀be⠀reversible.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀stand⠀in⠀a⠀rented⠀room⠀while⠀recalling⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀paid⠀for⠀it,⠀or⠀handle⠀an⠀obsolete⠀device⠀that⠀still⠀holds⠀a⠀voice⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀retrieve,⠀but⠀the⠀memory⠀must⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀with⠀the⠀system's⠀cost⠀attached.⠀The⠀room⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀empty;⠀its⠀current⠀rate,⠀lock,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀flag⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀means.\n\nLet⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀supply⠀pressure⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.⠀A⠀bargain⠀made⠀years⠀ago,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀outlived⠀its⠀original⠀purpose,⠀a⠀body⠀altered⠀for⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀ended:⠀these⠀can⠀shape⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflects⠀directly,⠀make⠀the⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀on⠀impermanence.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀particular⠀payment,⠀a⠀particular⠀scan,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀absence,⠀but⠀not⠀about⠀loss⠀as⠀an⠀abstract⠀condition.\n\nKeep⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀available.⠀A⠀meal⠀can⠀be⠀good,⠀a⠀message⠀can⠀arrive⠀on⠀time,⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed,⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀carries⠀debt⠀or⠀surveillance.⠀The⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀pleasure⠀and⠀remembered⠀cost⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀reflective⠀operation:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀good⠀moment⠀alongside⠀its⠀earlier⠀version⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀remain⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀memory⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀but⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀not,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀retroactively⠀inserted⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀modern⠀urban⠀realist⠀route⠀with⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀presentation.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀teller—a⠀fixer,⠀a⠀courier,⠀a⠀repair-shop⠀regular,⠀a⠀debt⠀mediator—to⠀an⠀audience⠀who⠀shares⠀some⠀of⠀the⠀world's⠀pressures.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀fiction,⠀not⠀a⠀decorative⠀introduction.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀relate,⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀already⠀knows,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀withholds⠀all⠀shape⠀the⠀information⠀flow.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀address⠀the⠀audience⠀directly,⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀pause⠀where⠀the⠀audience⠀would⠀already⠀understand⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀clearance⠀or⠀debt.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀enter⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀facts⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀from⠀practice.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀was⠀altered⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀debt⠀costs⠀are⠀the⠀realist⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀bargaining⠀session,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀encounter,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀changing⠀access⠀to⠀power⠀as⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric⠀decoration.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀can⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀them⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀speaks⠀differently⠀to⠀a⠀collector,⠀a⠀client,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀within⠀each⠀narrated⠀occasion.⠀The⠀teller⠀relates⠀brief⠀surfaces⠀and⠀carefully⠀selected⠀physical⠀impressions:⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀payment,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person's⠀hand⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀device.⠀What⠀is⠀omitted⠀matters⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀said.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀leave⠀an⠀interval⠀where⠀the⠀audience⠀must⠀infer⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀happened.⠀Attention⠀can⠀settle⠀on⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep—a⠀temporary⠀clearance,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀identity,⠀a⠀connection⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀survive⠀the⠀next⠀audit—without⠀turning⠀the⠀account⠀into⠀a⠀sermon⠀on⠀transience.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀limited⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narration⠀cannot⠀grant⠀itself⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀A⠀framed⠀account⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀someone⠀said⠀or⠀did,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀distinguish⠀the⠀teller's⠀inference⠀from⠀observed⠀fact.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀must⠀have⠀felt,⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀mark⠀that⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀construction,⠀not⠀as⠀confirmed⠀interiority.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀still⠀open—an⠀audience⠀member⠀asking⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀payment⠀still⠀pending—rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀one⠀register⠀a⠀system⠀pressure.⠀A⠀terminal⠀showing⠀an⠀overdue⠀balance,⠀a⠀scanner's⠀red⠀light,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀credit⠀check:⠀the⠀detail⠀survives⠀because⠀it⠀tells⠀the⠀reader⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays,⠀or⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀observed.⠀Choose⠀details⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀noir⠀inventory.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀the⠀chosen⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection,⠀but⠀the⠀feeling⠀must⠀be⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀atmospheric⠀mood.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀economical⠀movement.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀state⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀or⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀in⠀plain⠀terms,⠀then⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀fact.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀it⠀with⠀redundant⠀summary.⠀Omission⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀withholding⠀of⠀information.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀hesitates⠀before⠀a⠀scan,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀reason⠀from⠀the⠀debt⠀already⠀shown;⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀announce⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀door⠀fails⠀to⠀open,⠀the⠀credit⠀check⠀has⠀already⠀explained⠀why.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀attention⠀to⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep⠀through⠀the⠀selection⠀itself.⠀A⠀temporary⠀clearance,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀identity,⠀a⠀connection⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀survive⠀the⠀next⠀audit:⠀these⠀can⠀be⠀registered⠀in⠀a⠀brief⠀surface⠀rather⠀than⠀developed⠀at⠀length.⠀The⠀interval⠀between⠀details⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work.⠀A⠀significant⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀one⠀small⠀physical⠀fact,⠀and⠀that⠀fact⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀more⠀precisely⠀than⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀individual⠀voices⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀Minimalist⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀emotionally⠀identical⠀or⠀erase⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀but⠀specific;⠀another⠀character's⠀dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀practical.⠀Keep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀contract:⠀the⠀narration⠀cannot⠀grant⠀itself⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds,⠀and⠀a⠀withheld⠀thought⠀cannot⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀knowing⠀glance⠀that⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀prose⠀refuses⠀to⠀state.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world's⠀systems⠀are⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀conditions⠀of⠀ordinary⠀movement.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀a⠀clinic⠀where⠀an⠀implant⠀is⠀being⠀adjusted,⠀a⠀rental⠀office⠀where⠀a⠀deposit⠀is⠀refused,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀where⠀a⠀drone⠀passes⠀overhead.⠀Let⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀one⠀another,⠀using⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀author⠀profile,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀scene,⠀choose⠀one⠀carefully⠀selected⠀physical⠀impression⠀as⠀the⠀anchor.⠀The⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀chip,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀unlocks,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person's⠀hand⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀console:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀this⠀detail⠀while⠀passing⠀quickly⠀over⠀other⠀material.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene's⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀move⠀around⠀the⠀anchor,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀paused⠀before⠀unlocking⠀may⠀later⠀open⠀without⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀console⠀that⠀was⠀warm⠀may⠀have⠀cooled.⠀The⠀return⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling⠀that⠀an⠀explicit⠀statement⠀would⠀flatten.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀supply⠀pressure⠀through⠀concrete⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀facts.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀was⠀altered⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀debt⠀costs⠀are⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀scenes.⠀Investigation,⠀bargaining,⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀corporate⠀language,⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀enter⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀mandatory⠀scenery⠀list.⠀A⠀bargaining⠀scene⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀weight⠀as⠀a⠀chase⠀if⠀the⠀prose⠀attends⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀bargain⠀costs⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀watching.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience—reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀attention,⠀sensation—but⠀it⠀cannot⠀grant⠀itself⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀excludes.⠀Recollection⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀remembers,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀power.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀speaker⠀use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀pending,⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀pressures⠀of⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude⠀people⠀are⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop⠀for⠀the⠀relationship;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀conditions⠀under⠀which⠀it⠀operates.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀one⠀character⠀paying⠀for⠀another's⠀access,⠀covering⠀a⠀debt,⠀noticing⠀a⠀surveillance⠀flag,⠀or⠀waiting⠀outside⠀a⠀clinic⠀during⠀an⠀implant⠀adjustment.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀these⠀concrete⠀consequences,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀inserted⠀into⠀the⠀setting.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀language⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀access⠀and⠀payment⠀rituals.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ritual—the⠀way⠀one⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀device⠀before⠀entering⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀way⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀payment⠀chip⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place,⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀waits⠀outside⠀a⠀clinic⠀without⠀being⠀asked—can⠀recur⠀with⠀new⠀significance.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀restate⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀gesture⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀a⠀change:⠀the⠀device⠀is⠀checked⠀more⠀quickly⠀now,⠀the⠀chip⠀is⠀left⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀place,⠀the⠀waiting⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀necessary⠀or⠀has⠀become⠀more⠀costly.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀receive⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀they⠀belong,⠀but⠀they⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀established⠀ways⠀of⠀being⠀with⠀each⠀other.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀to⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀most⠀important⠀moments⠀may⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀brief⠀surface⠀or⠀an⠀interval⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀an⠀explicit⠀declaration.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀answered,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀rests⠀near⠀a⠀console,⠀and⠀that⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Attention⠀can⠀settle⠀on⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep—a⠀temporary⠀clearance,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀identity,⠀a⠀connection⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀survive⠀the⠀next⠀audit—and⠀the⠀relationship's⠀stakes⠀can⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀that⠀attention.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀relationship—longing,⠀uncertainty,⠀comfort,⠀resentment—but⠀it⠀cannot⠀grant⠀itself⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀What⠀one⠀character⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀shown,⠀said,⠀or⠀shared.⠀Keep⠀the⠀characters'⠀voices⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀both⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀comfort⠀given,⠀a⠀debt⠀unpaid,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀held⠀without⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀remember⠀one⠀another.⠀A⠀bargain⠀kept,⠀a⠀debt⠀carried,⠀an⠀access⠀granted⠀or⠀revoked,⠀a⠀body⠀altered⠀for⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀outlived⠀its⠀purpose:⠀these⠀are⠀the⠀acts⠀that⠀earn⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀chronicle⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀their⠀consequences.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀local⠀history⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀recurrence:⠀who⠀paid⠀the⠀deposit,⠀who⠀repaired⠀the⠀implant,⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀differently.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀A⠀courier's⠀run⠀remains⠀a⠀courier's⠀run⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.\n\nIntroduce⠀each⠀remembered⠀act⠀through⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀of⠀its⠀system⠀consequence,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀helping⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀give⠀the⠀chronicle⠀its⠀specific⠀weight:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀for⠀what⠀they⠀paid,⠀what⠀they⠀refused,⠀or⠀what⠀was⠀taken⠀from⠀them.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀within⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀Each⠀remembered⠀act⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀through⠀a⠀brief⠀surface⠀or⠀a⠀carefully⠀selected⠀physical⠀impression—the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀payment,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀device—rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀account.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀An⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀more⠀precisely⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀Attention⠀can⠀settle⠀on⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀a⠀temporary⠀clearance,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀identity,⠀a⠀connection⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀survive⠀the⠀next⠀audit.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀a⠀debt⠀negotiation⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀implant⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀social-psychological⠀realist⠀scene⠀grounded⠀in⠀one⠀specific⠀institutional⠀encounter:⠀a⠀housing⠀office,⠀a⠀clinic⠀intake,⠀a⠀municipal⠀data⠀request,⠀a⠀workplace⠀access⠀review,⠀or⠀a⠀credit⠀adjustment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀procedures⠀and⠀domestic⠀spaces⠀that⠀surround⠀the⠀encounter.⠀Do⠀not⠀default⠀to⠀neon⠀districts,⠀rain-slick⠀alleys,⠀or⠀implant⠀catalogues⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.\n\nSelect⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀physical⠀impressions⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling.⠀A⠀smudge⠀on⠀a⠀terminal,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀unlocks,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀number⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀refresh,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀window⠀reflects⠀the⠀room⠀while⠀the⠀outside⠀remains⠀visible.⠀Return⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀of⠀these⠀details⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀return⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀mean.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection⠀between⠀the⠀objects⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀state.⠀Omission⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀say.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institutional⠀encounter⠀unfold⠀through⠀procedure⠀and⠀social⠀position.⠀Who⠀must⠀approve⠀the⠀request?⠀What⠀document⠀is⠀missing?⠀Which⠀balance⠀changed⠀overnight?⠀What⠀does⠀the⠀system⠀record⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀leaves⠀the⠀room?⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀clerk,⠀the⠀applicant,⠀and⠀the⠀waiting⠀room⠀each⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀procedure⠀differently.⠀A⠀welfare⠀office⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀tense⠀as⠀a⠀corporate⠀tower,⠀and⠀a⠀family⠀kitchen⠀can⠀be⠀where⠀debt⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀bargain,⠀wait,⠀comply,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀mislead⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀situation.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀would⠀use⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀close⠀but⠀not⠀confessional.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀when⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀running⠀self-analysis.⠀Let⠀feeling⠀surface⠀through⠀action,⠀hesitation,⠀and⠀the⠀handling⠀of⠀small⠀objects.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀situation⠀without⠀announcing⠀that⠀understanding.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀context⠀precisely.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Swedish,⠀or⠀Norwegian,⠀keep⠀its⠀institutional⠀names,⠀weather,⠀housing⠀forms,⠀and⠀social⠀assumptions⠀distinct.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀backdrop⠀of⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀and⠀bleakness.⠀Let⠀the⠀ordinary⠀setting⠀make⠀the⠀unequal⠀power⠀feel⠀close⠀and⠀unavoidable.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends:⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀refused⠀request,⠀a⠀small⠀discovery,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀wait.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reversal,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀emotional⠀clarity.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀screenplay.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀action⠀blocks⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀scanned,⠀but⠀give⠀each⠀selected⠀detail⠀enough⠀physical⠀specificity⠀to⠀matter.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀world⠀carry⠀the⠀noir.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀sparingly.⠀A⠀character⠀touches⠀a⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀transit⠀card.⠀A⠀terminal⠀light⠀stays⠀amber.⠀A⠀coat⠀is⠀hung⠀carefully⠀while⠀a⠀conversation⠀continues.⠀A⠀window⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀street⠀in⠀different⠀weather.⠀The⠀repetition⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀detail,⠀not⠀merely⠀restate⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling⠀behind⠀every⠀object.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀see⠀the⠀pause,⠀the⠀glance,⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀move.\n\nStage⠀systemic⠀pressure⠀through⠀visible⠀screen⠀events:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀balance⠀that⠀changes,⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀supervisor,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀read⠀but⠀not⠀answered,⠀a⠀public⠀screen⠀displaying⠀an⠀old⠀notice.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀these⠀events⠀in⠀ways⠀that⠀reveal⠀their⠀position.⠀Someone⠀checks⠀a⠀device.⠀Someone⠀waits.⠀Someone⠀asks⠀the⠀wrong⠀question.⠀Someone⠀leaves⠀before⠀the⠀answer⠀arrives.⠀The⠀noir⠀is⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀not⠀in⠀mandatory⠀rain⠀or⠀neon.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀economical⠀and⠀socially⠀specific.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀position:⠀a⠀clerk⠀uses⠀procedure,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀uses⠀familiarity,⠀a⠀corporate⠀contact⠀uses⠀managed⠀reassurance.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀matters⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Let⠀a⠀question⠀go⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀request⠀be⠀deflected,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀replace⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀Silence⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀choice,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀sign⠀of⠀guilt.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀waiting⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀character⠀later,⠀with⠀the⠀interval⠀compressed.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀announcement⠀can⠀introduce⠀an⠀institutional⠀pressure⠀without⠀showing⠀its⠀source.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀permitted⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀chosen⠀scene⠀requires⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀If⠀the⠀contract⠀requires⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀dialogue⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀hear.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀stopping⠀point:⠀after⠀an⠀exchange,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀visible⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀stage⠀script.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Keep⠀stage⠀directions⠀economical⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions⠀or⠀prose⠀description⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀performed.\n\nLet⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀feeling⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀state.⠀A⠀character⠀straightens⠀a⠀chair⠀before⠀sitting.⠀Another⠀checks⠀a⠀device⠀and⠀then⠀puts⠀it⠀face⠀down.⠀Someone⠀enters⠀with⠀a⠀coat⠀still⠀on⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀it.⠀A⠀door⠀is⠀opened,⠀held,⠀and⠀released.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀of⠀these⠀actions⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀every⠀gesture⠀means.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀lines⠀and⠀the⠀business⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nStage⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀through⠀access⠀and⠀procedure.⠀A⠀character⠀cannot⠀enter⠀until⠀a⠀terminal⠀accepts⠀them.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀must⠀be⠀called.⠀A⠀balance⠀is⠀checked⠀on⠀a⠀handheld⠀device.⠀A⠀notice⠀is⠀read⠀aloud.⠀A⠀package⠀is⠀signed⠀for⠀but⠀not⠀opened.⠀Let⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀make⠀the⠀power⠀relations⠀visible:⠀who⠀sits,⠀who⠀stands,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀can⠀leave,⠀who⠀must⠀stay.⠀The⠀noir⠀is⠀in⠀these⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀mandatory⠀neon⠀set⠀or⠀a⠀weapon.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speaker's⠀position⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀A⠀housing⠀officer⠀speaks⠀in⠀procedure.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀speaks⠀through⠀familiarity.⠀A⠀company⠀representative⠀offers⠀managed⠀reassurance.⠀Let⠀characters⠀answer⠀indirectly,⠀leave⠀a⠀question⠀hanging,⠀or⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀polished⠀or⠀combative.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀answer,⠀or⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀to⠀decide⠀something⠀small.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀dramatic⠀situation⠀needs⠀them⠀and⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀them.⠀A⠀monologue⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀alone⠀and⠀speaking⠀to⠀themselves,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀formal⠀situation⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀statement.⠀An⠀aside⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀addresses⠀the⠀audience⠀directly⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀reason.⠀Neither⠀is⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀the⠀contract⠀requires⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀playable⠀stopping⠀point:⠀after⠀an⠀exit,⠀an⠀entrance,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀characters,⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀in⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀response⠀through⠀the⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀this⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀calmly⠀reasoning⠀through⠀a⠀problem⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀associations⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀sensory⠀details.⠀A⠀terminal's⠀amber⠀light⠀returns⠀with⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀another⠀room.⠀The⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀card⠀brings⠀back⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀once⠀held⠀it.⠀A⠀recorded⠀voice⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀settle.⠀The⠀cold⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀railing⠀arrives⠀with⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀stairwell.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀recur⠀and⠀change⠀their⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀moves.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀The⠀feeling⠀can⠀reside⠀in⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀enter⠀as⠀recurring⠀concern⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀plot⠀beats.⠀The⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀read,⠀a⠀face⠀behind⠀a⠀counter.⠀These⠀concerns⠀may⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀unrelated⠀perception⠀or⠀interrupt⠀a⠀memory.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀system⠀occupies⠀attention:⠀the⠀small⠀check,⠀the⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀looking⠀at⠀a⠀device⠀before⠀speaking.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀recurrence⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀discovery.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined⠀or⠀feared.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀by⠀a⠀sensory⠀trigger.⠀A⠀feared⠀outcome⠀may⠀be⠀marked⠀by⠀its⠀conditional⠀shape.⠀A⠀present⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀association⠀and⠀then⠀resumed.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀technique⠀make⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀excludes.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀position.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀works⠀with⠀procedure⠀may⠀think⠀in⠀procedural⠀phrases.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀excluded⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀exclusion.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀tired⠀may⠀lose⠀the⠀thread⠀and⠀come⠀back⠀to⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀associations⠀reveal⠀position⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀articulate⠀a⠀thesis⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀condition.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀actual⠀fictional⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀themes.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests⠀or⠀is⠀interrupted.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀realization,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀resolution.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀can⠀resume⠀the⠀same⠀associative⠀movement⠀or⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀present⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀message⠀exchange.⠀Use⠀clear⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself.⠀A⠀sender⠀uses⠀a⠀corporate⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀signature⠀block.⠀Another⠀sends⠀from⠀a⠀borrowed⠀device.⠀A⠀message⠀is⠀marked⠀read⠀but⠀not⠀answered.⠀A⠀balance⠀notification⠀interrupts⠀a⠀conversation.⠀A⠀form⠀requires⠀an⠀attachment⠀someone⠀does⠀not⠀have.⠀A⠀channel⠀changes⠀from⠀public⠀to⠀private.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀these⠀events,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀the⠀system.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀messages⠀selective.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀short⠀answer⠀where⠀a⠀longer⠀explanation⠀is⠀possible.⠀Another⠀may⠀type,⠀delete,⠀and⠀send⠀something⠀smaller.⠀A⠀third⠀may⠀forward⠀a⠀notice⠀without⠀comment.⠀Let⠀the⠀omissions⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀write⠀polished,⠀witty,⠀or⠀confessional⠀messages.⠀The⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀sent⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀without⠀a⠀running⠀explanation.\n\nDistinguish⠀sent⠀messages⠀from⠀unsent⠀drafts⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀read.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nLet⠀delays⠀and⠀receipts⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀waiting.⠀A⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀interruption,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀to⠀check⠀something.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀silence.⠀A⠀timestamp⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀a⠀message⠀arrived⠀too⠀late.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀delay⠀into⠀a⠀sign⠀of⠀deception.⠀The⠀waiting⠀itself⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀noir:⠀someone⠀is⠀outside⠀the⠀system,⠀someone⠀is⠀being⠀processed,⠀someone⠀is⠀waiting⠀for⠀permission.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀exchange⠀naturally⠀pauses⠀or⠀changes⠀state.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀go⠀unanswered.⠀A⠀draft⠀may⠀remain⠀unsent.⠀A⠀receipt⠀may⠀arrive.⠀A⠀channel⠀may⠀close.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀completed⠀negotiation,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀in⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀or⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀channel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀scene-oriented⠀visual⠀novel⠀prose.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nUse⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀may⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀occurs:⠀a⠀housing⠀office⠀with⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀transit⠀platform⠀at⠀night,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀with⠀a⠀terminal⠀on⠀the⠀table.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀a⠀reaction:⠀a⠀slight⠀smile⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀reach⠀the⠀eyes,⠀a⠀blank⠀look⠀while⠀a⠀number⠀is⠀read,⠀a⠀brief⠀frown⠀before⠀a⠀neutral⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀every⠀expression⠀as⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator⠀or⠀label⠀every⠀line⠀with⠀a⠀cue.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀cue⠀anchor⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀or⠀narration⠀complicate⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀focal⠀narration⠀close⠀and⠀selective.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices:⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀card,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀clerk's⠀screen⠀reflects⠀a⠀waiting⠀face.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀when⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀brief⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expressions⠀always⠀reveal⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀appear⠀through⠀scene⠀events.⠀A⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀permission⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀arrive.⠀Another⠀checks⠀a⠀balance⠀before⠀answering.⠀A⠀public⠀screen⠀displays⠀a⠀notice⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀conversation.⠀A⠀door⠀remains⠀closed⠀until⠀a⠀supervisor⠀approves.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀these⠀events.⠀The⠀noir⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀mandatory⠀neon⠀backdrop⠀or⠀a⠀weapon.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attributed⠀and⠀socially⠀specific.⠀A⠀clerk⠀speaks⠀in⠀procedure.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀speaks⠀through⠀familiarity.⠀A⠀corporate⠀contact⠀offers⠀managed⠀reassurance.⠀Let⠀characters⠀answer⠀indirectly,⠀leave⠀a⠀question⠀hanging,⠀or⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀answer.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀stopping⠀point:⠀after⠀an⠀exchange,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀visible⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaebabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀installment⠀in⠀a⠀continuing⠀serial.⠀Maintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.\n\nLet⠀selected⠀details⠀recur⠀across⠀installments⠀and⠀change⠀their⠀meaning.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀locked⠀is⠀now⠀open.⠀A⠀balance⠀that⠀was⠀stable⠀has⠀changed.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀waited⠀is⠀now⠀behind⠀the⠀counter.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀message⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀deepen⠀understanding,⠀not⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀suspicion.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀cumulative.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀A⠀character⠀learns⠀who⠀approves⠀the⠀request.⠀Another⠀gains⠀a⠀contact⠀but⠀owes⠀a⠀favor.⠀A⠀third⠀loses⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀once⠀felt⠀safe.⠀Show⠀how⠀these⠀developments⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀The⠀noir⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀ongoing⠀arrangements:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀records.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nPreserve⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀compression⠀within⠀the⠀serial⠀form.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀physical⠀impressions⠀for⠀each⠀installment⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀A⠀smudge⠀on⠀a⠀terminal,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀unlocks.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀The⠀serial⠀format⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀more⠀description;⠀it⠀requires⠀that⠀the⠀selected⠀details⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀return.⠀Omission⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀important⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀pressure.⠀A⠀character⠀eats,⠀waits,⠀works,⠀sleeps,⠀or⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor⠀while⠀a⠀larger⠀situation⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀Keep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀discovery,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀task⠀in⠀every⠀installment.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀after⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀small⠀change,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀An⠀occasional⠀hook⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀development⠀earns⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀ending⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
